  <data key="d270">The page includes a Teleport-sponsored passage, alongside quoted vendor/self-reported statistics. Its risk-calibrated review argument is practitioner commentary, not a controlled intervention; validate independent primary metrics before reusing any numbers.</data>
  <data key="d271">yes</data>
