  <data key="d79">Reliable agents in mature codebases need recovered tacit constraints and regression evidence before modifying code.</data>
  <data key="d80">Practitioner interpretation; not primary experimental evidence.</data>
  <data key="d81">Inventory external invariants and dependencies before delegation; Make brownfield changes incremental and reversible; Verify old behavior alongside new acceptance criteria.</data>
