  <data key="d173">2026-08-31</data>
  <data key="d79">Developers must deliberately practice reasoning, debugging and code comprehension when agents perform most implementation work.</data>
  <data key="d80">Practitioner interpretation; not primary experimental evidence.</data>
  <data key="d81">Preserve manual practice and counterfactual reasoning exercises; Measure retained comprehension rather than prompt throughput; Avoid confusing agent task success with human competence.</data>
  <data key="d82">Practitioner essay / technical guidance (not peer-reviewed)</data>
  <data key="d86">Practitioner essay / technical guidance (not peer-reviewed)</data>
  <data key="d85">Practitioner essay / technical guidance (not peer-reviewed)</data>
