  <data key="d79">Agent configuration and memory are perishable operational assets that should be periodically revalidated.</data>
  <data key="d80">Practitioner interpretation; not primary experimental evidence.</data>
  <data key="d81">Record an owner and expiry policy for agent instructions; Test whether each instruction changes verified behavior; Audit tool privileges and memory freshness independently.</data>
