  <data key="d87">article webpage read; linked empirical sources not all independently audited</data>
  <data key="d93">Instructions in AGENTS.md, CLAUDE.md, skills and durable memory can become outdated as tools and repositories change. Osmani recommends auditing usefulness, trimming redundant directives, testing outcomes and separating genuinely persistent facts from temporary guidance.</data>
