  <data key="d173">2026-08-14</data>
  <data key="d79">Effective autonomous loops begin with bounded goals, observable checks and explicit stopping rules.</data>
  <data key="d80">Practitioner interpretation; not primary experimental evidence.</data>
  <data key="d81">State an independent success predicate before granting retries; Limit cost, duration, permissions and edit scope; Escalate on ambiguity or verification exhaustion.</data>
