  <data key="d87">article webpage read; linked empirical sources not all independently audited</data>
  <data key="d93">Drawing on concurrent agent use, Osmani separates tasks safe for fully bounded delegation from tasks that require close review. He describes iterative act-test-revise operation while emphasizing constraints, definition of done and final human judgment where risk is material.</data>
  <data key="d264">Effective autonomous loops begin with bounded goals, observable checks and explicit stopping rules.</data>
  <data key="d265">State an independent success predicate before granting retries; Limit cost, duration, permissions and edit scope; Escalate on ambiguity or verification exhaustion.</data>
