  <data key="d270">Practitioner interpretation; not primary experimental evidence. Framework or market hypothesis is an authored practitioner proposal, not an empirically validated scale or intervention.</data>
  <data key="d271">yes</data>
  <data key="d90">https://addyo.substack.com/sitemap/2026</data>
