  <data key="d73">Agentic Code Review</data>
  <data key="d74">practitioner_article</data>
  <data key="d96">CURATED_PRACTITIONER_NOT_RESEARCH</data>
  <data key="d75">Verification &amp; review</data>
  <data key="d76">2026</data>
  <data key="d77">Addy Osmani</data>
  <data key="d78">https://addyo.substack.com/p/agentic-code-review</data>
  <data key="d168">https://addyo.substack.com/p/agentic-code-review</data>
  <data key="d226">https://addyo.substack.com/p/agentic-code-review</data>
  <data key="d173">2026-06-16</data>
  <data key="d79">AI-generated code moves the bottleneck from writing to justified acceptance, making review strategy a core engineering skill.</data>
  <data key="d80">Practitioner interpretation; not primary experimental evidence.</data>
  <data key="d81">Allocate human attention by risk rather than diff size; Audit automated reviewer false positives and misses; Preserve review as a team knowledge-transfer mechanism.</data>
  <data key="d82">Practitioner essay / technical guidance (not peer-reviewed)</data>
  <data key="d86">Practitioner essay / technical guidance (not peer-reviewed)</data>
  <data key="d85">Practitioner essay / technical guidance (not peer-reviewed)</data>
  <data key="d83">A</data>
  <data key="d87">article webpage read; linked empirical sources not all independently audited</data>
  <data key="d93">Osmani contrasts solo experiments and long-lived team repositories, arguing that risk, context, integration and shared learning demand different review methods. Review must consider correctness evidence, comprehension and how design decisions survive the handoff.</data>
  <data key="d264">AI-generated code moves the bottleneck from writing to justified acceptance, making review strategy a core engineering skill.</data>
  <data key="d265">Allocate human attention by risk rather than diff size; Audit automated reviewer false positives and misses; Preserve review as a team knowledge-transfer mechanism.</data>
