<node id="O014">
  <data key="d73">The Agent Stack Bet</data>
  <data key="d74">practitioner_article</data>
  <data key="d96">CURATED_PRACTITIONER_NOT_RESEARCH</data>
  <data key="d75">Code quality &amp; security</data>
  <data key="d76">2026</data>
  <data key="d77">Addy Osmani</data>
  <data key="d78">https://addyo.substack.com/p/the-agent-stack-bet</data>
  <data key="d168">https://addyo.substack.com/p/the-agent-stack-bet</data>
  <data key="d226">https://addyo.substack.com/p/the-agent-stack-bet</data>
  <data key="d173">2026-04-18</data>
  <data key="d79">Production agents need identity, authorization, observability and recovery controls beyond an impressive base model.</data>
  <data key="d80">Practitioner interpretation; not primary experimental evidence.</data>
  <data key="d81">Bind every action to scoped identity and human ownership; Restrict tool permissions and monitor effects; Design recoverable operations and audit trails for runtime failures.</data>
  <data key="d82">Practitioner essay / technical guidance (not peer-reviewed)</data>
  <data key="d86">Practitioner essay / technical guidance (not peer-reviewed)</data>
  <data key="d85">Practitioner essay / technical guidance (not peer-reviewed)</data>
  <data key="d83">A</data>
  <data key="d87">article webpage read; linked empirical sources not all independently audited</data>
  <data key="d93">Osmani describes fragile production plumbing: broad service-account permissions, schema drift, opaque state and broken recovery. The remedy is an explicit agent stack with task-scoped access, traceability, policy enforcement and durable error handling.</data>
  <data key="d264">Production agents need identity, authorization, observability and recovery controls beyond an impressive base model.</data>
  <data key="d265">Bind every action to scoped identity and human ownership; Restrict tool permissions and monitor effects; Design recoverable operations and audit trails for runtime failures.</data>
  <data key="d84">2026</data>
  <data key="d92">6.8</data>
  <data key="d266">C06</data>
  <data key="d267">Direct</data>
  <data key="d94">curated practitioner article (not a research study)</data>
