<node id="O021">
  <data key="d73">My LLM coding workflow going into 2026</data>
  <data key="d74">practitioner_article</data>
  <data key="d96">CURATED_PRACTITIONER_NOT_RESEARCH</data>
  <data key="d75">Engineering structure</data>
  <data key="d76">2025</data>
  <data key="d77">Addy Osmani</data>
  <data key="d78">https://addyo.substack.com/p/my-llm-coding-workflow-going-into</data>
  <data key="d168">https://addyo.substack.com/p/my-llm-coding-workflow-going-into</data>
  <data key="d226">https://addyo.substack.com/p/my-llm-coding-workflow-going-into</data>
  <data key="d173">2025-12-18</data>
  <data key="d79">Planning, scoped delegation and continuous checking outperform an unmanaged prompt-to-merge workflow as an engineering practice.</data>
  <data key="d80">Practitioner interpretation; not primary experimental evidence.</data>
  <data key="d81">Start from a task brief and acceptance criteria; Review after each small increment; Distinguish personal workflow preference from measured performance gains.</data>
  <data key="d82">Practitioner essay / technical guidance (not peer-reviewed)</data>
  <data key="d86">Practitioner essay / technical guidance (not peer-reviewed)</data>
  <data key="d85">Practitioner essay / technical guidance (not peer-reviewed)</data>
  <data key="d83">B</data>
  <data key="d87">article webpage read; linked empirical sources not all independently audited</data>
  <data key="d93">Osmani describes his own evolving approach to working with coding assistants: articulate a plan, provide repository context, implement bounded steps, execute tests and remain accountable for reviews and integration.</data>
  <data key="d264">Planning, scoped delegation and continuous checking outperform an unmanaged prompt-to-merge workflow as an engineering practice.</data>
  <data key="d265">Start from a task brief and acceptance criteria; Review after each small increment; Distinguish personal workflow preference from measured performance gains.</data>
  <data key="d84">2025</data>
  <data key="d92">4.6</data>
  <data key="d266">C04</data>
