  <data key="d73">Vibe coding is not the same as AI-Assisted engineering.</data>
  <data key="d74">practitioner_article</data>
  <data key="d96">CURATED_PRACTITIONER_NOT_RESEARCH</data>
  <data key="d75">Engineering structure</data>
  <data key="d76">2025</data>
  <data key="d77">Addy Osmani</data>
  <data key="d78">https://addyo.substack.com/p/vibe-coding-is-not-the-same-as-ai</data>
