  <data key="d87">article webpage read; linked empirical sources not all independently audited</data>
  <data key="d93">Osmani surveys emerging agentic tools and contrasts autocomplete, interactive assistants and agents that edit files, run commands, debug and propose pull requests. He argues that more capable execution increases the value of planning, context and final approval.</data>
