  <data key="d87">article webpage read; linked empirical sources not all independently audited</data>
  <data key="d93">The essay develops context engineering as information architecture: relevant files, architectural records, error logs, schemas, examples and acceptance constraints. It emphasizes curating high-signal context so a coding agent can act within repository realities.</data>
