  <data key="d173">2025-07-01</data>
  <data key="d79">An AI-native engineer integrates assistance into ordinary work while retaining domain expertise and continuous learning.</data>
  <data key="d80">Prospective productivity multipliers are hypothetical and should not be cited as empirical measurements.</data>
  <data key="d81">Teach effective delegation alongside manual competence; Create deliberate skill-updating routines; Do not present advertised 2x–10x multipliers as validated general results.</data>
  <data key="d82">Practitioner essay / technical guidance (not peer-reviewed)</data>
  <data key="d86">Practitioner essay / technical guidance (not peer-reviewed)</data>
