  <data key="d87">article webpage read; linked empirical sources not all independently audited</data>
  <data key="d93">Osmani presents a practical skills playbook for pairing with coding assistants, delegating repetitive work and learning better tool use. The article is intentionally aspirational about possible productivity multiples rather than a controlled performance study.</data>
  <data key="d264">An AI-native engineer integrates assistance into ordinary work while retaining domain expertise and continuous learning.</data>
  <data key="d265">Teach effective delegation alongside manual competence; Create deliberate skill-updating routines; Do not present advertised 2x–10x multipliers as validated general results.</data>
