  <data key="d226">https://addyo.substack.com/p/the-trust-but-verify-pattern-for</data>
  <data key="d173">2025-06-09</data>
  <data key="d79">Verification becomes the bottleneck when generation is cheap; every AI-produced change needs a justified check.</data>
  <data key="d80">Practitioner interpretation; not primary experimental evidence.</data>
  <data key="d81">Check against independent requirements and regression oracles; Record the outcome of manual and automated review; Teach why plausible code is not proof of correctness.</data>
  <data key="d82">Practitioner essay / technical guidance (not peer-reviewed)</data>
  <data key="d86">Practitioner essay / technical guidance (not peer-reviewed)</data>
