<node id="O034">
  <data key="d73">The Prompt Engineering Playbook for Programmers</data>
  <data key="d74">practitioner_article</data>
  <data key="d96">CURATED_PRACTITIONER_NOT_RESEARCH</data>
  <data key="d75">Engineering structure</data>
  <data key="d76">2025</data>
  <data key="d77">Addy Osmani</data>
  <data key="d78">https://addyo.substack.com/p/the-prompt-engineering-playbook-for</data>
  <data key="d168">https://addyo.substack.com/p/the-prompt-engineering-playbook-for</data>
  <data key="d226">https://addyo.substack.com/p/the-prompt-engineering-playbook-for</data>
  <data key="d173">2025-05-27</data>
  <data key="d79">Effective developer prompts state a bounded problem, relevant context, constraints and the expected verification method.</data>
  <data key="d80">Practitioner interpretation; not primary experimental evidence.</data>
  <data key="d81">Provide concrete files and constraints with each request; Make successful output observable; Iterate with feedback instead of claiming prompt wording ensures reliability.</data>
  <data key="d82">Practitioner essay / technical guidance (not peer-reviewed)</data>
  <data key="d86">Practitioner essay / technical guidance (not peer-reviewed)</data>
  <data key="d85">Practitioner essay / technical guidance (not peer-reviewed)</data>
  <data key="d83">B</data>
  <data key="d87">article webpage read; linked empirical sources not all independently audited</data>
  <data key="d93">Through contrasting examples, Osmani demonstrates how explicit role, environment, scope, format and feedback loops can improve coding-assistant usefulness. The book can reuse the patterns as task-envelope teaching devices rather than treat prompt form as a substitute for formal specifications.</data>
  <data key="d264">Effective developer prompts state a bounded problem, relevant context, constraints and the expected verification method.</data>
  <data key="d265">Provide concrete files and constraints with each request; Make successful output observable; Iterate with feedback instead of claiming prompt wording ensures reliability.</data>
