  <data key="d173">2025-02-09</data>
  <data key="d79">Lower creation costs may expand demand for one-off and personal applications, an economic hypothesis distinct from measured productivity or employment effects.</data>
  <data key="d80">Forward-looking economic scenario; no primary adoption or welfare evaluation.</data>
  <data key="d81">Separate prototype creation cost from lifecycle cost; Evaluate new demand and substitution scenarios independently; Mark market forecasts as hypotheses.</data>
