<node id="O049">
  <data key="d73">The 70% problem: Hard truths about AI-assisted coding</data>
  <data key="d74">practitioner_article</data>
  <data key="d96">CURATED_PRACTITIONER_NOT_RESEARCH</data>
  <data key="d75">Productivity</data>
  <data key="d76">2024</data>
  <data key="d77">Addy Osmani</data>
  <data key="d78">https://addyo.substack.com/p/the-70-problem-hard-truths-about</data>
  <data key="d168">https://addyo.substack.com/p/the-70-problem-hard-truths-about</data>
  <data key="d226">https://addyo.substack.com/p/the-70-problem-hard-truths-about</data>
  <data key="d173">2024-12-04</data>
  <data key="d79">Getting a prototype mostly implemented with AI is far easier than completing the remaining integrations and engineering assurances.</data>
  <data key="d80">The 70% estimate is an anecdotal framing, not a validated quantitative benchmark.</data>
  <data key="d81">Measure end-to-end shipping and rework instead of scaffolding speed; Identify integration and maintenance as separate work; Preserve the heuristic character of the percentage.</data>
  <data key="d82">Practitioner essay / technical guidance (not peer-reviewed)</data>
  <data key="d86">Practitioner essay / technical guidance (not peer-reviewed)</data>
  <data key="d85">Practitioner essay / technical guidance (not peer-reviewed)</data>
  <data key="d83">A</data>
  <data key="d87">article webpage read; linked empirical sources not all independently audited</data>
  <data key="d93">Osmani contrasts fast "zero-to-MVP" generation with difficult iteration, debugging and production readiness in realistic codebases. His memorable 70% phrasing is descriptive and experiential, not a controlled measurement of task success.</data>
  <data key="d264">Getting a prototype mostly implemented with AI is far easier than completing the remaining integrations and engineering assurances.</data>
  <data key="d265">Measure end-to-end shipping and rework instead of scaffolding speed; Identify integration and maintenance as separate work; Preserve the heuristic character of the percentage.</data>
  <data key="d84">2024</data>
  <data key="d92">2.5</data>
  <data key="d266">C02</data>
  <data key="d267">Direct</data>
  <data key="d94">curated practitioner article (not a research study)</data>
  <data key="d268">false</data>
  <data key="d269">W004;W010;W055</data>
  <data key="d95">Osmani public Substack sitemaps 2024/2025/2026 plus individual source URLs; independent editorial review 2026-10-10</data>
  <data key="d97">Overlay only; does not change any original W001-W193 evidence classification</data>
