  <data key="d303">[]</data>
  <data key="d79">A publication retrospective includes a 2024 reader survey describing respondents’ roles, employers, location and education, alongside the newsletter’s growth.</data>
  <data key="d264">A publication retrospective includes a 2024 reader survey describing respondents’ roles, employers, location and education, alongside the newsletter’s growth.</data>
  <data key="d93">A publication retrospective includes a 2024 reader survey describing respondents’ roles, employers, location and education, alongside the newsletter’s growth.</data>
  <data key="d265">The self-selected readership profile helps assess transferability of later reader surveys; subscriber growth itself is not software-engineering evidence.</data>
  <data key="d304">Visible arguments, author-reported observations and explicitly labeled outlines; no reconstruction of hidden sections.</data>
  <data key="d80">2,395 voluntary responses reported for a 2024 reader survey; not a census or random sample of software engineers. Public availability does not imply an independent check of every paragraph or chart. No microdata replication, controlled product test, or independent-rater agreement study was performed.</data>
  <data key="d81">A readership survey helps characterize the publication's audience and selection, not the entire engineering workforce.</data>
  <data key="d82">Industry/practitioner publication — publication retrospective and reader survey</data>
  <data key="d86">Industry/practitioner publication — publication retrospective and reader survey</data>
