  <data key="d93">Updates an earlier analysis of falling Stack Overflow question counts, considering moderation history, alternative communities and LLM-based assistance.</data>
  <data key="d265">The observations concern new questions, not all site usage or knowledge value. The headline and shutdown forecast go beyond what the descriptive series demonstrates.</data>
