  <data key="d80">Updated 19 May 2025. The causal contribution of LLMs is not identified by the time series. This non-Pulse-titled blog article is an excerpt of a Pulse issue originally published 2025-05-15. It passes the literal title-prefix rule; it is excluded by the optional stricter Pulse-origin filter. The parent issue is provenance only, not another P article. Public availability does not imply an independent check of every paragraph or chart. No microdata replication, controlled product test, or independent-rater agreement study was performed.</data>
