  <data key="d80">Claims about internal operations are attributed to former staff; corporate-failure explanations remain interpretations. This non-Pulse-titled blog article is an excerpt of a Pulse issue originally published 2025-06-12. It passes the literal title-prefix rule; it is excluded by the optional stricter Pulse-origin filter. The parent issue is provenance only, not another P article. Public availability does not imply an independent check of every paragraph or chart. No microdata replication, controlled product test, or independent-rater agreement study was performed.</data>
  <data key="d81">Industry fact-checking distinguishes reported AI code generation from human fulfilment. Neither a hypothetical architecture nor employee accounts validate a capability benchmark.</data>
