  <data key="d93">Examines maintenance-fee and other funding mechanisms for open-source work, including the burden of supporting users and reviewing contributions.</data>
  <data key="d265">Separates software availability from the recurring cost of stewardship. The examples do not establish that a particular fee model generalizes to every project.</data>
