  <data key="d79">An interview and excerpts from Nicole Forsgren and Abi Noda connect developer friction, organizational change and meaningful measurement.</data>
  <data key="d264">An interview and excerpts from Nicole Forsgren and Abi Noda connect developer friction, organizational change and meaningful measurement.</data>
  <data key="d93">An interview and excerpts from Nicole Forsgren and Abi Noda connect developer friction, organizational change and meaningful measurement.</data>
  <data key="d265">Faster generation need not remove delivery bottlenecks. The introduced book explicitly distinguishes practitioner guidance from the research foundations of Accelerate.</data>
  <data key="d304">Visible arguments, author-reported observations and explicitly labeled outlines; no reconstruction of hidden sections.</data>
  <data key="d80"> Public availability does not imply an independent check of every paragraph or chart. No microdata replication, controlled product test, or independent-rater agreement study was performed.</data>
  <data key="d81">Developer-friction guidance connects individual workflow to organizational delivery; a book excerpt is not a fresh experiment.</data>
