  <data key="d80">Uses the same respondent cohort as AI Tooling 2026 and key trends Part 2; not independent replication. Builders, shippers and coasters are interpretive response groupings, not a validated psychological or competency typology. The author reports 906 responses for the shared 2026 cohort. This is not an independently counted sample; comparisons with other survey waves are not a matched longitudinal panel. Subscriber-only article remainder not reviewed. No microdata replication, controlled product test, or independent-rater agreement study was performed.</data>
