  <data key="d93">An interview with Canonical explains accelerator support, local-model packaging, developer tooling and exploratory agent-friendly OS features. The preview distinguishes present hardware enablement from longer-term workflow plans.</data>
  <data key="d265">Running models and agents reliably requires infrastructure support, not just prompts. Planned capabilities should not be treated as shipping features or measured safety guarantees.</data>
