  <data key="d93">Orosz introduces authorized excerpts by Martin Kleppmann and Chris Riccomini on cloud versus self-hosting and engineers’ ethical responsibilities. The visible discussion relates operational control, expertise, workload variability and cost.</data>
  <data key="d265">Build/buy and hosting choices depend on workload and organizational capabilities. Excerpt authorship must be credited; this is not an Orosz experiment or an evaluation of coding agents.</data>
