  <data key="d80">Do not conflate this early ideas post with the later June 23 keynote summary; related but separate publications. Only a short introduction is publicly visible. P107 explicitly develops this theme later; the overlap cannot be fully assessed without authorized access to P103. No detailed findings are inferred from its title. Subscriber-only article remainder not reviewed. No microdata replication, controlled product test, or independent-rater agreement study was performed.</data>
