  <data key="d93">Interviews at Anthropic contrast accelerated migration and implementation with long-running infrastructure projects. The visible outline preserves planning, testing, small teams and engineering understanding despite changes in how code is produced.</data>
  <data key="d265">Faster implementation does not eliminate coordination or verification. Migration time and token figures are company reports with hypothetical pre-AI comparisons, not matched experimental results.</data>
