  <data key="d80">Reported migration duration is compared with an estimated engineering counterfactual, not a controlled time-saving experiment. Subscriber-only article remainder not reviewed. No microdata replication, controlled product test, or independent-rater agreement study was performed.</data>
  <data key="d81">The company case retains planning and verification despite accelerated implementation; hypothetical pre-AI comparisons remain unvalidated.</data>
