<node id="ISSUE:V6:W118_NORMALIZATION">
  <data key="d74">external_source_discrepancy</data>
  <data key="d73">W118: quiz percentage normalization unresolved</data>
  <data key="d183">OPEN_SOURCE_ISSUE_BOOK_QUALIFIED</data>
  <data key="d168">https://arxiv.org/pdf/2601.20245v2</data>
  <data key="d253">Section 5.2.2, printed page 9; main-study Figure 6, page 10</data>
  <data key="d338">4.15 points on a 27-point quiz gives 15.37 percentage points; source says 17%. Raw scores/normalization not reconciled.</data>
  <data key="d339">Figure 10.2 uses qualitative immediate-quiz outcome; Appendix B states discrepancy; no delayed-retention inference</data>
  <data key="d340">Targeted primary-page/arithmetic check, not participant-data reanalysis</data>
</node>
