<node id="B005">
  <data key="d73">Vibe Coding vs. AI-Assisted Engineering</data>
  <data key="d74">author_tex_section</data>
  <data key="d96">ND_INFORMATIONAL_TEX</data>
  <data key="d357">B</data>
  <data key="d358">V01</data>
  <data key="d363">Non-Deterministic Software Engineering</data>
  <data key="d364">AI_SW_ENG/chapters_verbose/chapter02_v3.tex</data>
  <data key="d356">abb747928eee306738180a372fd5226ccba87eac886e1c3ea22f88ee6e17acb7</data>
  <data key="d365">365</data>
  <data key="d366">3298</data>
  <data key="d367">chapter</data>
  <data key="d368">cards/V01/B005.md</data>
  <data key="d264">Vibe coding e ingegneria assistita differiscono per comprensione, controllo e responsabilità.</data>
  <data key="d93">Il testo delimita l’uso esplorativo dei prototipi, discute il problema del 70% e introduce specifiche e verifiche come alternativa alla mera prosecuzione della conversazione.</data>
  <data key="d80">Il 70% è un’euristica practitioner: non deve diventare un tasso universale di completamento o correttezza.</data>
  <data key="d369">T:Engineering structure</data>
  <data key="d370">["T:Engineering structure", "T:What agents can do", "T:Verification &amp; review", "T:Skills &amp; learning", "T:System knowledge &amp; memory"]</data>
  <data key="d371">["K:Developer workflow and adoption", "K:Human-agent collaboration", "K:Specifications and governance", "K:Independent verification and oracles", "K:Cognitive offloading and skill debt", "K:System understanding and rationale", "K:Ownership and knowledge transfer"]</data>
  <data key="d372">["C:C01", "C:C04", "C:C10"]</data>
  <data key="d373">[{"level": "section", "title": "Two Fundamentally Different Approaches", "line": 21, "offset": 1676, "end": 1724}, {"level": "section", "title": "When Vibes Meet Reality", "line": 79, "offset": 7228, "end": 7261}, {"level": "section", "title": "The Spec-Driven Alternative", "line": 209, "offset": 16189, "end": 16226}, {"level": "section", "title": "Organizational Implications", "line": 308, "offset": 23405, "end": 23442}]</data>
