<node id="B008">
  <data key="d73">The Quality Crisis (And How to Prevent It)</data>
  <data key="d74">author_tex_section</data>
  <data key="d96">ND_INFORMATIONAL_TEX</data>
  <data key="d357">B</data>
  <data key="d358">V01</data>
  <data key="d363">Non-Deterministic Software Engineering</data>
  <data key="d364">AI_SW_ENG/chapters_verbose/chapter05_v4.tex</data>
  <data key="d356">31cb9350dc88aef0f7ac2f8ef20be581d212c82b99c42be925d514dd90782ad2</data>
  <data key="d365">310</data>
  <data key="d366">4277</data>
  <data key="d367">chapter</data>
  <data key="d368">cards/V01/B008.md</data>
  <data key="d264">La qualità diventa critica quando il volume generato supera la capacità di revisione.</data>
  <data key="d93">Il capitolo combina debito tecnico, fiducia, colli di bottiglia e quality gate; invita a rendere verificabile l’accettazione e a mantenere una cultura di pensiero critico.</data>
  <data key="d80">Distinguere difetti dimostrati, segnalazioni statiche, percezioni dei revisori e spiegazioni causali.</data>
  <data key="d369">T:Verification &amp; review</data>
  <data key="d370">["T:Verification &amp; review", "T:Code quality &amp; security", "T:Engineering structure"]</data>
  <data key="d371">["K:Review capacity and maintainers", "K:AI as reviewer", "K:Automation bias and trust", "K:Architecture and modularity", "K:Technical debt and complexity"]</data>
  <data key="d372">["C:C05", "C:C08"]</data>
  <data key="d373">[{"level": "section", "title": "The Compounding Effect of Volume", "line": 20, "offset": 1186, "end": 1228}, {"level": "section", "title": "The Trust Problem", "line": 80, "offset": 8826, "end": 8853}, {"level": "section", "title": "The Critical Thinking Imperative", "line": 213, "offset": 22839, "end": 22881}, {"level": "section", "title": "The Path Forward", "line": 271, "offset": 29784, "end": 29810}]</data>
