<node id="B009">
  <data key="d73">Measuring What Matters---The Data Behind AI's Real Impact</data>
  <data key="d74">author_tex_section</data>
  <data key="d96">ND_INFORMATIONAL_TEX</data>
  <data key="d357">B</data>
  <data key="d358">V01</data>
  <data key="d363">Non-Deterministic Software Engineering</data>
  <data key="d364">AI_SW_ENG/chapters_verbose/chapter06_v4.tex</data>
  <data key="d356">3e5d40ca87c35ee64cb7f0dd7b55a9d07f12e00738955651fa8a57875bde4bc9</data>
  <data key="d365">367</data>
  <data key="d366">4794</data>
  <data key="d367">chapter</data>
  <data key="d368">cards/V01/B009.md</data>
  <data key="d264">La misura dell’AI deve includere il lavoro rilasciato, la qualità e l’esperienza dello sviluppatore.</data>
  <data key="d93">Il testo confronta narrazioni di produttività, dati industriali, soddisfazione, dimensione delle modifiche e vantaggi nella riduzione del lavoro ripetitivo.</data>
  <data key="d80">Il riferimento a 180+ organizzazioni non rende omogenee metriche, campioni o disegni; preservare denominatori e possibili interessi delle fonti.</data>
  <data key="d369">T:Productivity</data>
  <data key="d370">["T:Productivity", "T:Economics", "T:Verification &amp; review"]</data>
  <data key="d371">["K:Output versus shipped value", "K:Evaluation methodology and baselines", "K:Controlled productivity evidence"]</data>
  <data key="d372">["C:C02", "C:C12"]</data>
  <data key="d373">[{"level": "section", "title": "Understanding the Hype Problem", "line": 15, "offset": 1042, "end": 1082}, {"level": "section", "title": "The Surprising Hierarchy of Time Savings", "line": 164, "offset": 16180, "end": 16230}, {"level": "section", "title": "Hidden Benefits Beyond Time Savings", "line": 250, "offset": 25126, "end": 25171}, {"level": "section", "title": "Practical Guidance for Engineering Leaders", "line": 308, "offset": 32822, "end": 32874}]</data>
