<node id="B010">
  <data key="d73">The Adaptation Imperative---What Companies Must Do Now</data>
  <data key="d74">author_tex_section</data>
  <data key="d96">ND_INFORMATIONAL_TEX</data>
  <data key="d357">B</data>
  <data key="d358">V01</data>
  <data key="d363">Non-Deterministic Software Engineering</data>
  <data key="d364">AI_SW_ENG/chapters_verbose/chapter08_v4.tex</data>
  <data key="d356">5682d0823509380c14528b7d07abb1cccd56e5ecd396072b04697db07c93cc83</data>
  <data key="d365">433</data>
  <data key="d366">4765</data>
  <data key="d367">chapter</data>
  <data key="d368">cards/V01/B010.md</data>
  <data key="d264">L’adozione richiede una trasformazione di processi e competenze, non soltanto licenze.</data>
  <data key="d93">Otto principi, una roadmap di sei mesi e adattamenti per dimensione aziendale traducono il cambiamento tecnico in responsabilità e decisioni organizzative.</data>
  <data key="d80">La roadmap è una proposta operativa; tempi e ritorni devono essere calibrati sul contesto anziché assunti come dimostrati.</data>
  <data key="d369">T:Engineering structure</data>
  <data key="d370">["T:Engineering structure", "T:Productivity", "T:Skills &amp; learning", "T:Verification &amp; review"]</data>
  <data key="d371">["K:Developer workflow and adoption", "K:Evaluation methodology and baselines", "K:Specifications and governance", "K:Ownership and knowledge transfer"]</data>
  <data key="d372">["C:C11", "C:C12"]</data>
  <data key="d373">[{"level": "section", "title": "Contrasting Approaches: Speed Versus Rigor", "line": 15, "offset": 1182, "end": 1234}, {"level": "section", "title": "Measuring AI's Real Impact", "line": 180, "offset": 14624, "end": 14660}, {"level": "section", "title": "Your 6-Month Roadmap", "line": 190, "offset": 15973, "end": 16003}, {"level": "section", "title": "For Individual Contributors", "line": 402, "offset": 34084, "end": 34121}]</data>
