<node id="B011">
  <data key="d73">Looking Forward---The Future of Software Engineering</data>
  <data key="d74">author_tex_section</data>
  <data key="d96">ND_INFORMATIONAL_TEX</data>
  <data key="d357">B</data>
  <data key="d358">V01</data>
  <data key="d363">Non-Deterministic Software Engineering</data>
  <data key="d364">AI_SW_ENG/chapters_verbose/chapter09_v4.tex</data>
  <data key="d356">3cc847ac00e2eb21da6b48122b67386387ba80b81c12ba0549e1a18b91959e0d</data>
  <data key="d365">373</data>
  <data key="d366">4375</data>
  <data key="d367">chapter</data>
  <data key="d368">cards/V01/B011.md</data>
  <data key="d264">Le traiettorie future sono scenari da usare per prepararsi, non previsioni certe.</data>
  <data key="d93">Il capitolo articola orizzonti temporali e implicazioni di carriera, distinguendo possibilità favorevoli e rischi per la professione.</data>
  <data key="d80">Conservare l’ancoraggio temporale dell’edizione: prospettive a 12–18 mesi o a più anni non sono fatti accertati oggi.</data>
  <data key="d369">T:Jobs &amp; roles</data>
  <data key="d370">["T:Jobs &amp; roles", "T:Skills &amp; learning", "T:What agents can do", "T:Engineering structure"]</data>
  <data key="d371">["K:Employment and early-career roles", "K:Ownership and knowledge transfer", "K:Agent failure and escalation", "K:Long-running agent execution"]</data>
  <data key="d372">["C:C01", "C:C11", "C:C12"]</data>
  <data key="d373">[{"level": "section", "title": "The Near Future: 12--18 Months", "line": 15, "offset": 1232, "end": 1272}, {"level": "section", "title": "The Long Term: 5+ Years", "line": 227, "offset": 17261, "end": 17294}, {"level": "section", "title": "The Fork in the Road", "line": 295, "offset": 26884, "end": 26914}, {"level": "section", "title": "Your Next Steps", "line": 321, "offset": 30594, "end": 30619}]</data>
