<node id="B013">
  <data key="d73">PART I: Core Practices</data>
  <data key="d74">author_tex_section</data>
  <data key="d96">ND_INFORMATIONAL_TEX</data>
  <data key="d357">B</data>
  <data key="d358">V01</data>
  <data key="d363">Non-Deterministic Software Engineering</data>
  <data key="d364">AI_SW_ENG/chapters_verbose/chapter07/chapter07_part1.tex</data>
  <data key="d356">d18e91e3e4da41faaeb2ab3780e8680a9360f3b04dc48cfdf64dd2c706d89219</data>
  <data key="d365">1462</data>
  <data key="d366">5604</data>
  <data key="d367">section</data>
  <data key="d368">cards/V01/B013.md</data>
  <data key="d264">Le pratiche di base uniscono specifica, test, piccoli passi, contesto e comprensione.</data>
  <data key="d93">I primi otto pattern comprendono spec-first, TDD, esplorazione, chunk verificabili, context engineering, explainability test, runtime feedback e tutela dell’apprendimento.</data>
  <data key="d80">Saper spiegare un risultato non è una prova sufficiente di correttezza; la verifica comportamentale deve restare separata.</data>
  <data key="d369">T:Engineering structure</data>
  <data key="d370">["T:Engineering structure", "T:Verification &amp; review", "T:Code quality &amp; security", "T:Skills &amp; learning", "T:System knowledge &amp; memory"]</data>
  <data key="d371">["K:Specifications and governance", "K:Independent verification and oracles", "K:Evaluation methodology and baselines", "K:Skills formation and teaching", "K:Cognitive offloading and skill debt"]</data>
  <data key="d372">["C:C04", "C:C07", "C:C10"]</data>
  <data key="d373">[{"level": "section", "title": "PART I: Core Practices", "line": 3, "offset": 2, "end": 35}]</data>
