<node id="B024">
  <data key="d73">Context Flow Control: Managing Complex Sessions</data>
  <data key="d74">author_tex_section</data>
  <data key="d96">ND_INFORMATIONAL_TEX</data>
  <data key="d357">B</data>
  <data key="d358">V01</data>
  <data key="d363">Non-Deterministic Software Engineering</data>
  <data key="d364">AI_SW_ENG/chapters_verbose/chapter10/05_context_flow.tex</data>
  <data key="d356">e4c09a224cbac8339536664e6162fbafc708bae4e46667cf8008cd78f962f370</data>
  <data key="d365">346</data>
  <data key="d366">1419</data>
  <data key="d367">section</data>
  <data key="d368">cards/V01/B024.md</data>
  <data key="d264">Compattazione e handoff governano la continuità delle sessioni complesse.</data>
  <data key="d93">Plan mode, riepiloghi e passaggi strutturati sono strumenti per controllare l’accumulo del contesto e conservare lo stato del lavoro.</data>
  <data key="d80">Un riepilogo può perdere vincoli o spiegazioni; i passaggi di stato devono essere verificabili rispetto agli artefatti originari.</data>
  <data key="d369">T:System knowledge &amp; memory</data>
  <data key="d370">["T:System knowledge &amp; memory", "T:What agents can do"]</data>
  <data key="d371">["K:Agent context and persistent memory", "K:System understanding and rationale", "K:Long-running agent execution"]</data>
  <data key="d372">["C:C03", "C:C09"]</data>
  <data key="d373">[{"level": "section", "title": "Context Flow Control: Managing Complex Sessions", "line": 2, "offset": 1, "end": 58}]</data>
