<node id="B027">
  <data key="d73">Team Collaboration \&amp; Knowledge Sharing</data>
  <data key="d74">author_tex_section</data>
  <data key="d96">ND_INFORMATIONAL_TEX</data>
  <data key="d357">B</data>
  <data key="d358">V01</data>
  <data key="d363">Non-Deterministic Software Engineering</data>
  <data key="d364">AI_SW_ENG/chapters_verbose/chapter10/08_team_collaboration.tex</data>
  <data key="d356">f25d348c036c0954b18c5d1837930f434106612fc32cf6ab1562a67bfd80db3e</data>
  <data key="d365">330</data>
  <data key="d366">1073</data>
  <data key="d367">section</data>
  <data key="d368">cards/V01/B027.md</data>
  <data key="d264">L’adozione collettiva richiede trasmissione delle pratiche e decisioni condivise.</data>
  <data key="d93">La sezione tratta librerie di prompt, collaborazione, competenze e ruoli complementari di persone e agenti.</data>
  <data key="d80">La condivisione degli artefatti non dimostra comprensione condivisa: servono verifiche di handoff e capacità autonome.</data>
  <data key="d369">T:Skills &amp; learning</data>
  <data key="d370">["T:Skills &amp; learning", "T:System knowledge &amp; memory", "T:Engineering structure", "T:Verification &amp; review"]</data>
