<node id="B028">
  <data key="d73">Security, Compliance \&amp; Governance</data>
  <data key="d74">author_tex_section</data>
  <data key="d96">ND_INFORMATIONAL_TEX</data>
  <data key="d357">B</data>
  <data key="d358">V01</data>
  <data key="d363">Non-Deterministic Software Engineering</data>
  <data key="d364">AI_SW_ENG/chapters_verbose/chapter10/09_security.tex</data>
  <data key="d356">b8f5fff344bf416debc2851e29e9120b3ab90966db395ace2696f806ab0e4072</data>
  <data key="d365">975</data>
  <data key="d366">4534</data>
  <data key="d367">section</data>
  <data key="d368">cards/V01/B028.md</data>
  <data key="d264">La sicurezza degli agenti richiede difesa stratificata e controllo continuo.</data>
  <data key="d93">Policy-as-code, guardrail, flussi di dati, monitoraggio e risposta agli incidenti compongono il quadro operativo.</data>
  <data key="d80">Gli esempi non costituiscono un audit di conformità; distinguere regole applicate, osservabilità e rischio residuo.</data>
  <data key="d369">T:Code quality &amp; security</data>
  <data key="d370">["T:Code quality &amp; security", "T:What agents can do", "T:Engineering structure", "T:System knowledge &amp; memory", "T:Verification &amp; review"]</data>
  <data key="d371">["K:Prompt injection and malicious tools", "K:Vulnerability and secure code", "K:Dependencies and agent supply chain", "K:Specifications and governance", "K:Ownership and knowledge transfer"]</data>
  <data key="d372">["C:C06", "C:C11"]</data>
  <data key="d373">[{"level": "section", "title": "Security, Compliance \\&amp; Governance", "line": 2, "offset": 1, "end": 45}]</data>
