<node id="B030">
  <data key="d73">Common Pitfalls to Avoid</data>
  <data key="d74">author_tex_section</data>
  <data key="d96">ND_INFORMATIONAL_TEX</data>
  <data key="d357">B</data>
  <data key="d358">V01</data>
  <data key="d363">Non-Deterministic Software Engineering</data>
  <data key="d364">AI_SW_ENG/chapters_verbose/chapter10/11_pitfalls.tex</data>
  <data key="d356">43b8d038a2bd2750d637c5b1b3b4304394d2b56c4b42d6af8e7ff4aa981be13e</data>
  <data key="d365">1534</data>
  <data key="d366">5636</data>
  <data key="d367">section</data>
  <data key="d368">cards/V01/B030.md</data>
  <data key="d264">Gli errori ricorrenti di adozione vanno diagnosticati prima di aggiungere strumenti.</data>
  <data key="d93">Il file approfondisce trappole pratiche e le raccorda agli antipattern del catalogo: contesto, batch, sicurezza, competenze e metriche.</data>
  <data key="d80">La somiglianza fra antipattern non è una nuova osservazione indipendente; usarli come checklist e ipotesi da misurare.</data>
  <data key="d369">T:What agents can do</data>
  <data key="d370">["T:What agents can do", "T:Verification &amp; review", "T:Code quality &amp; security", "T:Skills &amp; learning", "T:System knowledge &amp; memory"]</data>
  <data key="d371">["K:Agent failure and escalation", "K:Evaluation methodology and baselines", "K:Review capacity and maintainers", "K:AI as reviewer", "K:Automation bias and trust", "K:Cognitive offloading and skill debt", "K:System understanding and rationale", "K:Ownership and knowledge transfer"]</data>
  <data key="d372">["C:C03", "C:C08", "C:C10"]</data>
  <data key="d373">[{"level": "section", "title": "Common Pitfalls to Avoid", "line": 2, "offset": 1, "end": 35}]</data>
