<node id="B031">
  <data key="d73">First 90-Days Implementation Roadmap</data>
  <data key="d74">author_tex_section</data>
  <data key="d96">ND_INFORMATIONAL_TEX</data>
  <data key="d357">B</data>
  <data key="d358">V01</data>
  <data key="d363">Non-Deterministic Software Engineering</data>
  <data key="d364">AI_SW_ENG/chapters_verbose/chapter10/12_roadmap.tex</data>
  <data key="d356">eeb8597bff408474a39e7206e6f8bfa0cc022a5ed832d7092a94cb975e646d91</data>
  <data key="d365">206</data>
  <data key="d366">1125</data>
  <data key="d367">section</data>
  <data key="d368">cards/V01/B031.md</data>
  <data key="d264">Un pilot di novanta giorni deve partire da baseline e concludersi con una decisione motivata.</data>
  <data key="d93">La roadmap organizza preparazione, sperimentazione, passaggio fra gruppi e criteri di go/no-go, collegandosi alla roadmap strategica di sei mesi.</data>
  <data key="d80">Il calendario è prescrittivo; il successo va deciso su esiti e qualità misurati, non sul mero completamento delle settimane.</data>
  <data key="d369">T:Engineering structure</data>
  <data key="d370">["T:Engineering structure", "T:Productivity", "T:Skills &amp; learning", "T:Verification &amp; review"]</data>
  <data key="d371">["K:Developer workflow and adoption", "K:Evaluation methodology and baselines", "K:Controlled productivity evidence"]</data>
  <data key="d372">["C:C02", "C:C11"]</data>
  <data key="d373">[{"level": "section", "title": "First 90-Days Implementation Roadmap", "line": 2, "offset": 1, "end": 47}]</data>
