  <data key="d356">90feff4e44644d90c9be9a4fc45a98f5f2ddc32b60a0cd62089c01c14dd598ea</data>
  <data key="d365">471</data>
  <data key="d366">3630</data>
  <data key="d367">appendix</data>
  <data key="d368">cards/V01/B035.md</data>
  <data key="d264">L’adozione europea combina responsabilità, provenienza e scelte di sovranità operativa.</data>
  <data key="d93">L’appendice tratta quadro regolatorio, rischio delle dipendenze, dati, architetture ibride e AI-BOM come esigenze connesse alla pratica ingegneristica.</data>
  <data key="d80">Le affermazioni giuridiche e le scadenze sono solo indicizzate, non riconfermate: prima del riuso servono verifica normativa aggiornata e valutazione competente.</data>
  <data key="d369">T:Code quality &amp; security</data>
  <data key="d370">["T:Code quality &amp; security", "T:Engineering structure", "T:Economics", "T:What agents can do"]</data>
  <data key="d371">["K:Dependencies and agent supply chain", "K:Specifications and governance", "K:Ownership and knowledge transfer", "K:Prompt injection and malicious tools", "K:Vulnerability and secure code", "K:Economic costs and return", "K:Long-running agent execution"]</data>
  <data key="d372">["C:C06", "C:C11", "C:C12"]</data>
  <data key="d373">[{"level": "section", "title": "Introduction: A Different Calculus", "line": 7, "offset": 239, "end": 283}, {"level": "section", "title": "The Regulatory Landscape: Three Critical Frameworks", "line": 53, "offset": 4016, "end": 4077}, {"level": "section", "title": "Operational Sovereignty Assessment", "line": 356, "offset": 23319, "end": 23363}, {"level": "section", "title": "Conclusion: A European Path", "line": 422, "offset": 26991, "end": 27028}]</data>
