<node id="B039">
  <data key="d73">The Process</data>
  <data key="d74">author_tex_section</data>
  <data key="d96">ND_INFORMATIONAL_TEX</data>
  <data key="d357">B</data>
  <data key="d358">V02</data>
  <data key="d363">Non-Deterministic Spec-driven Development</data>
  <data key="d364">AI_SDD_ENG/chapters/chapter02_process.tex</data>
  <data key="d356">d496238586c77b97533a3851a22bb7a35ff1af1be938da000d1acd7b880781ce</data>
  <data key="d365">557</data>
  <data key="d366">3520</data>
  <data key="d367">chapter</data>
  <data key="d368">cards/V02/B039.md</data>
  <data key="d264">Quattro fasi e quattro gate organizzano il passaggio dall’intento all’implementazione.</data>
  <data key="d93">Costituzione, chiarimenti, selezione del modello, analisi di consistenza e checklist rendono esplicite le condizioni di avanzamento.</data>
  <data key="d80">La sequenza dei gate va distinta dalla rigidità waterfall: cambiamenti tardivi richiedono invalidazione e rivalidazione degli artefatti interessati.</data>
  <data key="d369">T:Engineering structure</data>
  <data key="d370">["T:Engineering structure", "T:System knowledge &amp; memory", "T:Verification &amp; review", "T:Code quality &amp; security"]</data>
  <data key="d371">["K:Specifications and governance", "K:System understanding and rationale", "K:Independent verification and oracles", "K:Evaluation methodology and baselines"]</data>
  <data key="d372">["C:C04", "C:C07"]</data>
  <data key="d373">[{"level": "section", "title": "Four Phases, Four Gates", "line": 20, "offset": 1046, "end": 1079}, {"level": "section", "title": "Model Selection Strategy", "line": 241, "offset": 12809, "end": 12843}, {"level": "section", "title": "The Clarification Phase", "line": 361, "offset": 20337, "end": 20370}, {"level": "section", "title": "Quality Checklists: Unit Tests for English", "line": 467, "offset": 25412, "end": 25464}]</data>
  <data key="d362">Enrico Papalini</data>
  <data key="d82">Author-authored engineering synthesis, guidance or reference apparatus</data>
  <data key="d374">File-level content mapping and citation-identity tracing; no independent validation or code execution</data>
