<node id="B041">
  <data key="d73">The Integration</data>
  <data key="d74">author_tex_section</data>
  <data key="d96">ND_INFORMATIONAL_TEX</data>
  <data key="d357">B</data>
  <data key="d358">V02</data>
  <data key="d363">Non-Deterministic Spec-driven Development</data>
  <data key="d364">AI_SDD_ENG/chapters/chapter04_integration.tex</data>
  <data key="d356">c50eb677650ac6e7c616679dafbe4a864c4306cc720ccff9e355ec1cbec2fe84</data>
  <data key="d365">2550</data>
  <data key="d366">9387</data>
  <data key="d367">chapter</data>
  <data key="d368">cards/V02/B041.md</data>
  <data key="d264">SDD si integra con workflow esistenti e responsabilità dei team multi-ruolo.</data>
  <data key="d93">Le mappature verso i capitoli del primo volume e i playbook collegano specifiche, tooling e collaborazione in contesti enterprise e brownfield.</data>
  <data key="d80">La corrispondenza documentale non prova efficacia organizzativa; servono esperimenti su handoff, ambiguità e intenzioni modificate.</data>
  <data key="d369">T:Engineering structure</data>
  <data key="d370">["T:Engineering structure", "T:System knowledge &amp; memory", "T:What agents can do", "T:Verification &amp; review"]</data>
  <data key="d371">["K:Specifications and governance", "K:System understanding and rationale", "K:Human-agent collaboration", "K:Review capacity and maintainers", "K:Long-running agent execution", "K:Ownership and knowledge transfer"]</data>
  <data key="d372">["C:C04", "C:C11"]</data>
