<node id="B042">
  <data key="d73">Advanced Patterns</data>
  <data key="d74">author_tex_section</data>
  <data key="d96">ND_INFORMATIONAL_TEX</data>
  <data key="d357">B</data>
  <data key="d358">V02</data>
  <data key="d363">Non-Deterministic Spec-driven Development</data>
  <data key="d364">AI_SDD_ENG/chapters/chapter05_patterns.tex</data>
  <data key="d356">a5d81ef982282d03e93f32f344890d01e05eb138a89c84e7d4fda6818e602e0d</data>
  <data key="d365">1107</data>
  <data key="d366">4763</data>
  <data key="d367">chapter</data>
  <data key="d368">cards/V02/B042.md</data>
  <data key="d264">Sette pattern estendono il catalogo originario alla gestione delle specifiche.</data>
  <data key="d93">Costituzione, chiarificazione anticipata, consistenza, conservazione della ricerca, esplorazione parallela, scala delle specifiche e cambio del modello compongono un catalogo specifico.</data>
  <data key="d80">La ripetizione di un pattern nei volumi successivi non aumenta il numero di osservazioni; l’efficacia resta da valutare nel contesto d’uso.</data>
  <data key="d369">T:Engineering structure</data>
  <data key="d370">["T:Engineering structure", "T:Verification &amp; review", "T:System knowledge &amp; memory", "T:What agents can do"]</data>
  <data key="d371">["K:Specifications and governance", "K:Independent verification and oracles", "K:System understanding and rationale", "K:Human-agent collaboration", "K:Review capacity and maintainers", "K:Long-running agent execution"]</data>
  <data key="d372">["C:C04", "C:C09", "C:C11"]</data>
  <data key="d373">[{"level": "section", "title": "Extending the Pattern Catalog", "line": 16, "offset": 494, "end": 534}, {"level": "section", "title": "Pattern Overview", "line": 85, "offset": 4218, "end": 4245}]</data>
  <data key="d362">Enrico Papalini</data>
  <data key="d82">Author-authored engineering synthesis, guidance or reference apparatus</data>
  <data key="d374">File-level content mapping and citation-identity tracing; no independent validation or code execution</data>
