<node id="B043">
  <data key="d73">Limitations and Judgment</data>
  <data key="d74">author_tex_section</data>
  <data key="d96">ND_INFORMATIONAL_TEX</data>
  <data key="d357">B</data>
  <data key="d358">V02</data>
  <data key="d363">Non-Deterministic Spec-driven Development</data>
  <data key="d364">AI_SDD_ENG/chapters/chapter06_limitations.tex</data>
  <data key="d356">7b1ea36d975dbe6f0affa38604fcf3948632188646a5489e4e404bb06222e48b</data>
  <data key="d365">456</data>
  <data key="d366">2289</data>
  <data key="d367">chapter</data>
  <data key="d368">cards/V02/B043.md</data>
  <data key="d264">Il valore di SDD dipende dal contesto e dai costi di mantenimento degli artefatti.</data>
  <data key="d93">Il capitolo affronta documenti troppo lunghi, casi inadatti, aggiornamento delle specifiche e misurazione del successo, ponendo limiti all’adozione indiscriminata.</data>
  <data key="d80">Non presentare come misurate soglie di convenienza o riduzioni di difetti che il testo propone soltanto come euristiche.</data>
  <data key="d369">T:Engineering structure</data>
  <data key="d370">["T:Engineering structure", "T:System knowledge &amp; memory", "T:Productivity", "T:Verification &amp; review"]</data>
  <data key="d371">["K:Specifications and governance", "K:System understanding and rationale", "K:Controlled productivity evidence", "K:Evaluation methodology and baselines"]</data>
  <data key="d372">["C:C02", "C:C04"]</data>
  <data key="d373">[{"level": "section", "title": "The Walls of Text Problem", "line": 20, "offset": 974, "end": 1009}, {"level": "section", "title": "When Spec-Driven Development Doesn't Fit", "line": 138, "offset": 4680, "end": 4730}, {"level": "section", "title": "Measuring SDD Success", "line": 295, "offset": 10967, "end": 10998}, {"level": "section", "title": "Honest Assessment", "line": 379, "offset": 15955, "end": 15982}]</data>
