<node id="B045">
  <data key="d73">Complete Implementation Examples</data>
  <data key="d74">author_tex_section</data>
  <data key="d96">ND_INFORMATIONAL_TEX</data>
  <data key="d357">B</data>
  <data key="d358">V02</data>
  <data key="d363">Non-Deterministic Spec-driven Development</data>
  <data key="d364">AI_SDD_ENG/appendices/appendix_examples.tex</data>
  <data key="d356">9e3081d62ba108f76aeb1189b308242273d9900bbe0ed9756e2ea979c0e2af26</data>
  <data key="d365">762</data>
  <data key="d366">3039</data>
  <data key="d367">appendix</data>
  <data key="d368">cards/V02/B045.md</data>
  <data key="d264">Due esempi mostrano come gli artefatti si collegano in un percorso end-to-end.</data>
  <data key="d93">Notifications N+1 e Sprintify rappresentano rispettivamente estensione di un sistema e greenfield enterprise; il contributo è la continuità fra specifica, pianificazione e verifica.</data>
  <data key="d80">Gli esempi sono didattici; non sono stati eseguiti né trasformati in pilot con esiti produttivi misurati.</data>
  <data key="d369">T:Engineering structure</data>
  <data key="d370">["T:Engineering structure", "T:System knowledge &amp; memory", "T:Verification &amp; review", "T:Code quality &amp; security"]</data>
  <data key="d371">["K:Specifications and governance", "K:System understanding and rationale", "K:Independent verification and oracles", "K:Evaluation methodology and baselines"]</data>
  <data key="d372">["C:C04", "C:C07"]</data>
  <data key="d373">[{"level": "section", "title": "Choosing the Right Example", "line": 10, "offset": 375, "end": 411}, {"level": "section", "title": "Example: Notifications Feature (N+1)", "line": 38, "offset": 1597, "end": 1643}, {"level": "section", "title": "Example: Sprintify (Enterprise Greenfield)", "line": 215, "offset": 7275, "end": 7327}, {"level": "section", "title": "Further Reading", "line": 755, "offset": 25151, "end": 25176}]</data>
