<node id="B050">
  <data key="d73">The Process: Four Phases, Four Gates</data>
  <data key="d74">author_tex_section</data>
  <data key="d96">ND_INFORMATIONAL_TEX</data>
  <data key="d357">B</data>
  <data key="d358">V03</data>
  <data key="d363">Non-Deterministic Spec-driven Development — 2nd edition</data>
  <data key="d364">AI_SDD_ENG_V2/chapters/chapter02_process.tex</data>
  <data key="d356">be96b58d8095aafc81871af38d2b2fbd0451e9a3427b85b44777293235de5ae8</data>
  <data key="d365">328</data>
  <data key="d366">4123</data>
  <data key="d367">chapter</data>
  <data key="d368">cards/V03/B050.md</data>
  <data key="d264">Il processo a gate viene generalizzato oltre una singola implementazione.</data>
  <data key="d93">La seconda edizione aggiunge refinement stack, selezione per fase, confronto fra istanziazioni e failure mode delle quattro fasi.</data>
  <data key="d80">Un gate può essere superato con artefatti formalmente coerenti ma intenzioni sbagliate; definire cosa il controllo dimostra e cosa lascia aperto.</data>
  <data key="d369">T:Engineering structure</data>
  <data key="d370">["T:Engineering structure", "T:System knowledge &amp; memory", "T:Verification &amp; review", "T:Code quality &amp; security"]</data>
  <data key="d371">["K:Specifications and governance", "K:System understanding and rationale", "K:Independent verification and oracles", "K:Evaluation methodology and baselines"]</data>
  <data key="d372">["C:C04", "C:C07"]</data>
