<node id="B057">
  <data key="d73">The Comparison: Patterns, Divergences, and Convergences</data>
  <data key="d74">author_tex_section</data>
  <data key="d96">ND_INFORMATIONAL_TEX</data>
  <data key="d357">B</data>
  <data key="d358">V03</data>
  <data key="d363">Non-Deterministic Spec-driven Development — 2nd edition</data>
  <data key="d364">AI_SDD_ENG_V2/chapters/chapter09_comparison.tex</data>
  <data key="d356">45be338524ea5b8bf299ba0d524c0959fbadcdc38bdd0a5b81d6fa3dfad45262</data>
  <data key="d365">626</data>
  <data key="d366">8041</data>
  <data key="d367">chapter</data>
  <data key="d368">cards/V03/B057.md</data>
  <data key="d264">Dodici dimensioni rendono espliciti convergenze e disaccordi fra framework.</data>
  <data key="d93">Tabella di confronto, mappe strategiche e quattro divergenze filosofiche organizzano le scelte senza limitarsi a elencare funzionalità.</data>
  <data key="d80">Le posizioni nelle mappe e nei quadranti sono giudizi editoriali, non misure statistiche o classifiche indipendenti.</data>
  <data key="d369">T:Engineering structure</data>
  <data key="d370">["T:Engineering structure", "T:Productivity", "T:Skills &amp; learning", "T:Code quality &amp; security"]</data>
  <data key="d371">["K:Developer workflow and adoption", "K:Evaluation methodology and baselines", "K:Architecture and modularity", "K:Technical debt and complexity"]</data>
  <data key="d372">["C:C03", "C:C04", "C:C11"]</data>
  <data key="d373">[{"level": "section", "title": "The Twelve Core Comparison Dimensions", "line": 20, "offset": 1022, "end": 1069}, {"level": "section", "title": "Strategic Maps: Three Magic Quadrants", "line": 171, "offset": 18678, "end": 18725}, {"level": "section", "title": "Thematic Deep-Dives", "line": 429, "offset": 34076, "end": 34105}, {"level": "section", "title": "The Divergence Map: Four Irreducible Philosophical Splits", "line": 575, "offset": 58472, "end": 58539}]</data>
  <data key="d362">Enrico Papalini</data>
  <data key="d82">Author-authored engineering synthesis, guidance or reference apparatus</data>
  <data key="d374">File-level content mapping and citation-identity tracing; no independent validation or code execution</data>
