</node>
<node id="B059">
  <data key="d73">Constitution and Architecture: The Framework Foundation</data>
  <data key="d74">author_tex_section</data>
  <data key="d96">ND_INFORMATIONAL_TEX</data>
  <data key="d357">B</data>
  <data key="d358">V03</data>
  <data key="d363">Non-Deterministic Spec-driven Development — 2nd edition</data>
  <data key="d364">AI_SDD_ENG_V2/chapters/chapter11_foundation.tex</data>
  <data key="d356">8fadfb701661d64f294a2b51180d2fc1749af952a6f15c9e099ce3b2d4f6b4fc</data>
  <data key="d365">592</data>
  <data key="d366">4983</data>
  <data key="d367">chapter</data>
  <data key="d368">cards/V03/B059.md</data>
  <data key="d264">Enterprise SDD combina costituzione, architettura e progressione controllata.</data>
  <data key="d93">Il capitolo racconta la composizione del framework attraverso vincoli inviolabili, pipeline a sei fasi e gate, raccordando l’ecosistema alla proposta dell’autore.</data>
  <data key="d80">La storia di composizione non è una validazione indipendente; mantenere separate scelte progettuali, conformità formale ed esiti reali.</data>
  <data key="d369">T:Engineering structure</data>
  <data key="d370">["T:Engineering structure", "T:Verification &amp; review", "T:Code quality &amp; security"]</data>
  <data key="d371">["K:Specifications and governance", "K:Ownership and knowledge transfer", "K:Architecture and modularity", "K:Technical debt and complexity", "K:Independent verification and oracles"]</data>
  <data key="d372">["C:C04", "C:C05", "C:C11"]</data>
  <data key="d373">[{"level": "section", "title": "Five Days With Enterprise SDD", "line": 28, "offset": 1394, "end": 1433}, {"level": "section", "title": "Core Philosophy", "line": 139, "offset": 13030, "end": 13055}, {"level": "section", "title": "The Six-Phase Pipeline", "line": 183, "offset": 18800, "end": 18832}, {"level": "section", "title": "Constitution-Driven Development in Practice", "line": 414, "offset": 30897, "end": 30950}]</data>
  <data key="d362">Enrico Papalini</data>
  <data key="d82">Author-authored engineering synthesis, guidance or reference apparatus</data>
  <data key="d374">File-level content mapping and citation-identity tracing; no independent validation or code execution</data>
