<node id="B060">
  <data key="d73">The Agent Pipeline and Gates</data>
  <data key="d74">author_tex_section</data>
  <data key="d96">ND_INFORMATIONAL_TEX</data>
  <data key="d357">B</data>
  <data key="d358">V03</data>
  <data key="d363">Non-Deterministic Spec-driven Development — 2nd edition</data>
  <data key="d364">AI_SDD_ENG_V2/chapters/chapter12_agents.tex</data>
  <data key="d356">0eeb7ee0be66f6453866402f554996d7834eabd8d3648fa4e594b9c24442c901</data>
  <data key="d365">867</data>
  <data key="d366">8254</data>
  <data key="d367">chapter</data>
  <data key="d368">cards/V03/B060.md</data>
  <data key="d264">La pipeline degli agenti rende espliciti artefatti, handoff e autorità dei gate.</data>
  <data key="d93">Catalogo dei ruoli, agenti multi-mode, Three Amigos, livelli di cerimonia, pipeline di sicurezza e gestione delle domande descrivono il funzionamento interno di Enterprise SDD.</data>
  <data key="d80">Il numero di agenti e di gate non misura qualità; servono prove su fallimenti concorrenti, risposte tardive e intenzioni modificate.</data>
  <data key="d369">T:What agents can do</data>
  <data key="d370">["T:What agents can do", "T:Engineering structure", "T:Verification &amp; review", "T:Code quality &amp; security"]</data>
  <data key="d371">["K:Human-agent collaboration", "K:Review capacity and maintainers", "K:Long-running agent execution", "K:Specifications and governance", "K:Ownership and knowledge transfer", "K:Independent verification and oracles", "K:Evaluation methodology and baselines"]</data>
  <data key="d372">["C:C04", "C:C07", "C:C11"]</data>
  <data key="d373">[{"level": "section", "title": "The Agent Topology at a Glance", "line": 28, "offset": 1369, "end": 1409}, {"level": "section", "title": "Complete Agent Catalog", "line": 259, "offset": 21141, "end": 21173}, {"level": "section", "title": "Gate Anatomy", "line": 535, "offset": 43963, "end": 43985}, {"level": "section", "title": "From sdd new to sdd ship : a full lap", "line": 774, "offset": 58707, "end": 58767}]</data>
