<node id="B061">
  <data key="d73">Automation and Extensibility: CLI, Modules, and MCP</data>
  <data key="d74">author_tex_section</data>
  <data key="d96">ND_INFORMATIONAL_TEX</data>
  <data key="d357">B</data>
  <data key="d358">V03</data>
  <data key="d363">Non-Deterministic Spec-driven Development — 2nd edition</data>
  <data key="d364">AI_SDD_ENG_V2/chapters/chapter13_automation.tex</data>
  <data key="d356">e1f633e1cc1dca1637da2923b8c5275dc4707462a8677259629a68a52e023395</data>
  <data key="d365">732</data>
  <data key="d366">6550</data>
  <data key="d367">chapter</data>
  <data key="d368">cards/V03/B061.md</data>
  <data key="d264">CLI, adattatori e moduli rendono estensibile il framework senza cambiare il suo nucleo concettuale.</data>
  <data key="d93">Il capitolo presenta sessione terminale, preset, MCP, issue sync, skill e controlli di salute, mostrando come collegare agenti e artefatti all’ambiente operativo.</data>
  <data key="d80">Le superfici CLI e gli adattatori non sono stati eseguiti; compatibilità e sicurezza devono essere provate sulla versione concreta.</data>
  <data key="d369">T:Engineering structure</data>
  <data key="d370">["T:Engineering structure", "T:What agents can do", "T:System knowledge &amp; memory", "T:Code quality &amp; security"]</data>
  <data key="d371">["K:Developer workflow and adoption", "K:Specifications and governance", "K:Agent context and persistent memory", "K:System understanding and rationale", "K:Dependencies and agent supply chain", "K:Prompt injection and malicious tools"]</data>
  <data key="d372">["C:C03", "C:C06", "C:C09"]</data>
  <data key="d373">[{"level": "section", "title": "A 90-Second Terminal Session", "line": 28, "offset": 1271, "end": 1309}, {"level": "section", "title": "User Modules", "line": 331, "offset": 23732, "end": 23754}, {"level": "section", "title": "MCP Servers", "line": 472, "offset": 32976, "end": 32997}, {"level": "section", "title": "The sdd doctor Framework Health Check", "line": 631, "offset": 43994, "end": 44048}]</data>
  <data key="d362">Enrico Papalini</data>
