<node id="B063">
  <data key="d73">Advanced Patterns: From Frameworks to Practice</data>
  <data key="d74">author_tex_section</data>
  <data key="d96">ND_INFORMATIONAL_TEX</data>
  <data key="d357">B</data>
  <data key="d358">V03</data>
  <data key="d363">Non-Deterministic Spec-driven Development — 2nd edition</data>
  <data key="d364">AI_SDD_ENG_V2/chapters/chapter15_patterns.tex</data>
  <data key="d356">4830546709bc5f2eb4641c47add3bb9992eb9089497514ac25f321b33f5f92aa</data>
  <data key="d365">778</data>
  <data key="d366">11299</data>
  <data key="d367">chapter</data>
  <data key="d368">cards/V03/B063.md</data>
  <data key="d264">Diciannove pattern compongono gestione delle specifiche, coordinamento, sicurezza e autonomia.</data>
  <data key="d93">I gruppi A–D includono chiarimento, red teaming, gap closure, handoff, anti-sycophancy, gate, supply chain, evidence pack e budget.</data>
  <data key="d80">I pattern condividono fonti e meccanismi con capitoli precedenti; non aggregarli come risultati autonomi di efficacia.</data>
  <data key="d369">T:Engineering structure</data>
  <data key="d370">["T:Engineering structure", "T:Verification &amp; review", "T:What agents can do", "T:Code quality &amp; security"]</data>
  <data key="d371">["K:Specifications and governance", "K:Independent verification and oracles", "K:Human-agent collaboration", "K:Review capacity and maintainers", "K:Long-running agent execution", "K:Prompt injection and malicious tools", "K:Vulnerability and secure code", "K:Agent failure and escalation"]</data>
  <data key="d372">["C:C04", "C:C06", "C:C07", "C:C11"]</data>
  <data key="d373">[{"level": "section", "title": "Pattern Structure", "line": 20, "offset": 1015, "end": 1043}, {"level": "section", "title": "Group B: Agent Coordination", "line": 263, "offset": 25351, "end": 25388}, {"level": "section", "title": "Group C: Quality and Safety", "line": 396, "offset": 40080, "end": 40117}, {"level": "section", "title": "Enterprise SDD Implementation Notes", "line": 715, "offset": 75875, "end": 75920}]</data>
  <data key="d362">Enrico Papalini</data>
  <data key="d82">Author-authored engineering synthesis, guidance or reference apparatus</data>
  <data key="d374">File-level content mapping and citation-identity tracing; no independent validation or code execution</data>
