<node id="B065">
  <data key="d73">How to Design a New Framework</data>
  <data key="d74">author_tex_section</data>
  <data key="d96">ND_INFORMATIONAL_TEX</data>
  <data key="d357">B</data>
  <data key="d358">V03</data>
  <data key="d363">Non-Deterministic Spec-driven Development — 2nd edition</data>
  <data key="d364">AI_SDD_ENG_V2/chapters/chapter17_design_framework.tex</data>
  <data key="d356">995ee712004747b56e01abb6e71919950669b2896eba76087f46d27b86045fb9</data>
  <data key="d365">325</data>
  <data key="d366">4897</data>
  <data key="d367">chapter</data>
  <data key="d368">cards/V03/B065.md</data>
  <data key="d264">Progettare un nuovo framework significa partire da problemi e vincoli osservati.</data>
  <data key="d93">Four-Question Test, light evolution loop, storia di composizione di Enterprise SDD ed esempio Genesis definiscono una metodologia di evoluzione incrementale.</data>
  <data key="d80">Il metodo di progettazione è una proposta; non va presentato come algoritmo che garantisce un framework più efficace.</data>
  <data key="d369">T:Engineering structure</data>
  <data key="d370">["T:Engineering structure", "T:What agents can do", "T:Verification &amp; review"]</data>
  <data key="d371">["K:Developer workflow and adoption", "K:Specifications and governance", "K:Ownership and knowledge transfer"]</data>
  <data key="d372">["C:C04", "C:C11"]</data>
  <data key="d373">[{"level": "section", "title": "A Light Methodology: The Four-Question Test", "line": 12, "offset": 1059, "end": 1112}, {"level": "section", "title": "The Light Evolution Loop", "line": 99, "offset": 8450, "end": 8484}, {"level": "section", "title": "Worked Example: Enterprise SDD's Composition Story", "line": 115, "offset": 11200, "end": 11260}, {"level": "section", "title": "Supporting Exemplar: Genesis as a Meta-Framework", "line": 200, "offset": 23726, "end": 23784}]</data>
  <data key="d362">Enrico Papalini</data>
  <data key="d82">Author-authored engineering synthesis, guidance or reference apparatus</data>
  <data key="d374">File-level content mapping and citation-identity tracing; no independent validation or code execution</data>
  <data key="d375">NO</data>
  <data key="d95">ND.zip, 2026-10-11; original file retained unchanged</data>
</node>
<node id="B066">
  <data key="d73">Installation and Setup</data>
  <data key="d74">author_tex_section</data>
  <data key="d96">ND_INFORMATIONAL_TEX</data>
  <data key="d357">B</data>
  <data key="d358">V03</data>
  <data key="d363">Non-Deterministic Spec-driven Development — 2nd edition</data>
  <data key="d364">AI_SDD_ENG_V2/appendices/appendix_setup.tex</data>
  <data key="d356">6f4e96375b8e453691a7331cc62d4a78842d9323b43f9956152f32e5a2ff6ff3</data>
  <data key="d365">550</data>
  <data key="d366">3285</data>
  <data key="d367">appendix</data>
  <data key="d368">cards/V03/B066.md</data>
  <data key="d264">La guida di installazione rende verificabili prerequisiti e configurazione del framework.</data>
  <data key="d93">Setup, sdd init, variabili, MCP, adattatori, moduli, troubleshooting e riferimento CLI formano il percorso di avvio di Enterprise SDD.</data>
  <data key="d80">L’installazione non è stata ripetuta in questa analisi; richiede una verifica su ambiente, release e permessi effettivi.</data>
  <data key="d369">T:Engineering structure</data>
  <data key="d370">["T:Engineering structure", "T:Productivity", "T:Skills &amp; learning", "T:Code quality &amp; security", "T:System knowledge &amp; memory"]</data>
  <data key="d371">["K:Developer workflow and adoption", "K:Evaluation methodology and baselines", "K:Dependencies and agent supply chain", "K:Prompt injection and malicious tools"]</data>
  <data key="d372">["C:C03", "C:C06"]</data>
  <data key="d373">[{"level": "section", "title": "Prerequisites", "line": 10, "offset": 277, "end": 300}, {"level": "section", "title": "Environment Variables and MCP Configuration", "line": 209, "offset": 9983, "end": 10036}, {"level": "section", "title": "Module Installation", "line": 324, "offset": 15036, "end": 15065}, {"level": "section", "title": "Quick-Start Checklist", "line": 525, "offset": 27976, "end": 28007}]</data>
  <data key="d362">Enrico Papalini</data>
  <data key="d82">Author-authored engineering synthesis, guidance or reference apparatus</data>
  <data key="d374">File-level content mapping and citation-identity tracing; no independent validation or code execution</data>
