<node id="B067">
  <data key="d73">Playbooks</data>
  <data key="d74">author_tex_section</data>
  <data key="d96">ND_INFORMATIONAL_TEX</data>
  <data key="d357">B</data>
  <data key="d358">V03</data>
  <data key="d363">Non-Deterministic Spec-driven Development — 2nd edition</data>
  <data key="d364">AI_SDD_ENG_V2/appendices/appendix_playbooks.tex</data>
  <data key="d356">768d4170053a9348e6740381002f0a8e19fddd39149f301bf503d061127ba5ea</data>
  <data key="d365">623</data>
  <data key="d366">3031</data>
  <data key="d367">appendix</data>
  <data key="d368">cards/V03/B067.md</data>
  <data key="d264">I playbook trasformano la metodologia in sequenze per scenari di delivery diversi.</data>
  <data key="d93">Greenfield, N+1, brownfield, hotfix, batch autonomo e Three Amigos mostrano come adattare la stessa struttura al rischio e alle responsabilità.</data>
  <data key="d80">Le sei sequenze sono prescrittive; non costituiscono sei esperimenti o esiti produttivi indipendenti.</data>
  <data key="d369">T:Engineering structure</data>
  <data key="d370">["T:Engineering structure", "T:System knowledge &amp; memory", "T:What agents can do"]</data>
  <data key="d371">["K:Specifications and governance", "K:System understanding and rationale", "K:Agent failure and escalation", "K:Long-running agent execution"]</data>
  <data key="d372">["C:C04", "C:C11"]</data>
  <data key="d373">[{"level": "section", "title": "Playbook 1: Greenfield Project", "line": 10, "offset": 264, "end": 304}, {"level": "section", "title": "Playbook 3: Legacy Integration (Brownfield)", "line": 267, "offset": 9956, "end": 10009}, {"level": "section", "title": "Playbook 4: Emergency Hotfix", "line": 338, "offset": 13527, "end": 13565}, {"level": "section", "title": "Playbook 6: Multi-Role Team Feature (Three Amigos)", "line": 549, "offset": 22634, "end": 22694}]</data>
  <data key="d362">Enrico Papalini</data>
  <data key="d82">Author-authored engineering synthesis, guidance or reference apparatus</data>
  <data key="d374">File-level content mapping and citation-identity tracing; no independent validation or code execution</data>
