<node id="B068">
  <data key="d73">Template Reference</data>
  <data key="d74">author_tex_section</data>
  <data key="d96">ND_INFORMATIONAL_TEX</data>
  <data key="d357">B</data>
  <data key="d358">V03</data>
  <data key="d363">Non-Deterministic Spec-driven Development — 2nd edition</data>
  <data key="d364">AI_SDD_ENG_V2/appendices/appendix_templates.tex</data>
  <data key="d356">c748b7ed2bc789816a50a82c446b253db7286e300f4f4455007fcb5313f6bbaa</data>
  <data key="d365">586</data>
  <data key="d366">2254</data>
  <data key="d367">appendix</data>
  <data key="d368">cards/V03/B068.md</data>
  <data key="d264">I dodici template rendono esplicita la struttura documentale di Enterprise SDD.</data>
  <data key="d93">Business context, spec, chiarimenti, piano, test, task, costituzione, bridge, escalation, gap, checklist e metadati forniscono una grammatica comune.</data>
  <data key="d80">Il catalogo rende visibile la densità degli artefatti; non dimostra assenza di duplicazione né sostituisce la verifica dell’intento.</data>
  <data key="d369">T:Engineering structure</data>
  <data key="d370">["T:Engineering structure", "T:Verification &amp; review", "T:System knowledge &amp; memory"]</data>
  <data key="d371">["K:Specifications and governance", "K:Independent verification and oracles", "K:Ownership and knowledge transfer", "K:Agent context and persistent memory", "K:System understanding and rationale"]</data>
  <data key="d372">["C:C04", "C:C09", "C:C11"]</data>
  <data key="d373">[{"level": "section", "title": "Template 1: business-context.md", "line": 10, "offset": 317, "end": 365}, {"level": "section", "title": "Template 5: test-cases.md", "line": 212, "offset": 5541, "end": 5583}, {"level": "section", "title": "Template 8: Context Bridge", "line": 366, "offset": 9853, "end": 9889}, {"level": "section", "title": "Template 12: Feature Meta JSON Schema", "line": 561, "offset": 15867, "end": 15914}]</data>
