<node id="B085">
  <data key="d73">The Continuous Development Revolution</data>
  <data key="d74">author_tex_section</data>
  <data key="d96">ND_INFORMATIONAL_TEX</data>
  <data key="d357">B</data>
  <data key="d358">V04</data>
  <data key="d363">Non-Deterministic Autonomous Coding Agents</data>
  <data key="d364">ai-auto_eng/AI_AUTO_ENG/chapters/chapter01_revolution.tex</data>
  <data key="d356">59c19cee9311375de9d39144d6318c63f37871af01d55d8d8a1774aa99d5304f</data>
  <data key="d365">398</data>
  <data key="d366">3879</data>
  <data key="d367">chapter</data>
  <data key="d368">cards/V04/B085.md</data>
  <data key="d264">Lo sviluppo continuativo combina esecuzione autonoma, contesto rinnovato e una frontiera umana di approvazione.</data>
  <data key="d93">Il capitolo lega Ralph, apprendimento cumulativo, specifiche, infrastruttura di test e controllo di versione a un flusso che prepara lavoro per la revisione.</data>
  <data key="d80">La narrazione del lavoro da 50.000 dollari svolto con 297 dollari di API non misura ROI comparabile: mancano costo umano, baseline e denominatore della qualità accettata.</data>
  <data key="d369">T:What agents can do</data>
  <data key="d370">["T:What agents can do", "T:Engineering structure", "T:Verification &amp; review", "T:Code quality &amp; security"]</data>
  <data key="d371">["K:Agent failure and escalation", "K:Long-running agent execution", "K:Independent verification and oracles", "K:Review capacity and maintainers", "K:AI as reviewer", "K:Automation bias and trust"]</data>
  <data key="d372">["C:C01", "C:C03", "C:C08"]</data>
  <data key="d373">[{"level": "section", "title": "From Reactive to Proactive AI", "line": 25, "offset": 1824, "end": 1863}, {"level": "section", "title": "The Continuous Loop Concept", "line": 117, "offset": 10440, "end": 10477}, {"level": "section", "title": "Prerequisites for Success", "line": 246, "offset": 18642, "end": 18677}, {"level": "section", "title": "What This Book Will Teach You", "line": 319, "offset": 25530, "end": 25569}]</data>
  <data key="d362">Enrico Papalini</data>
  <data key="d82">Author-authored engineering synthesis, guidance or reference apparatus</data>
  <data key="d374">File-level content mapping and citation-identity tracing; no independent validation or code execution</data>
