<node id="B088">
  <data key="d73">The Ralph Loop Pattern</data>
  <data key="d74">author_tex_section</data>
  <data key="d96">ND_INFORMATIONAL_TEX</data>
  <data key="d357">B</data>
  <data key="d358">V04</data>
  <data key="d363">Non-Deterministic Autonomous Coding Agents</data>
  <data key="d364">ai-auto_eng/AI_AUTO_ENG/chapters/chapter04_ralph.tex</data>
  <data key="d356">bc33f212af1d60604b0a868e40a9cd2c1d385092dbc68579a76bebfc1ebb2d03</data>
  <data key="d365">703</data>
  <data key="d366">4095</data>
  <data key="d367">chapter</data>
  <data key="d368">cards/V04/B088.md</data>
  <data key="d264">Il pattern Ralph ripete un incarico con contesto fresco e progresso conservato fuori dal modello.</data>
  <data key="d93">Anatomia, ciclo di iterazione, varianti implementative, primo esercizio e diagnosi iniziale trasformano il loop in una procedura concreta.</data>
  <data key="d80">Un segnale di completamento o un test passato non garantiscono che l’intento sia soddisfatto; i comandi non sono stati eseguiti in questa analisi.</data>
  <data key="d369">T:What agents can do</data>
  <data key="d370">["T:What agents can do", "T:Verification &amp; review", "T:Engineering structure", "T:System knowledge &amp; memory", "T:Code quality &amp; security"]</data>
  <data key="d371">["K:Long-running agent execution", "K:Agent failure and escalation", "K:Independent verification and oracles", "K:Agent context and persistent memory", "K:System understanding and rationale", "K:Evaluation methodology and baselines"]</data>
  <data key="d372">["C:C03", "C:C07", "C:C09"]</data>
  <data key="d373">[{"level": "section", "title": "Anatomy of a Ralph Loop", "line": 20, "offset": 1582, "end": 1615}, {"level": "section", "title": "Implementation Options", "line": 328, "offset": 16885, "end": 16917}, {"level": "section", "title": "Your First Ralph Loop", "line": 416, "offset": 21659, "end": 21690}, {"level": "section", "title": "Troubleshooting Common Issues", "line": 650, "offset": 30115, "end": 30154}]</data>
