<node id="B090">
  <data key="d73">Memory and Context Engineering</data>
  <data key="d74">author_tex_section</data>
  <data key="d96">ND_INFORMATIONAL_TEX</data>
  <data key="d357">B</data>
  <data key="d358">V04</data>
  <data key="d363">Non-Deterministic Autonomous Coding Agents</data>
  <data key="d364">ai-auto_eng/AI_AUTO_ENG/chapters/chapter06_memory.tex</data>
  <data key="d356">46beb0d7a4f5a99ab0393394551dc7016d76c6d09e941ea203076ef24e723c2a</data>
  <data key="d365">591</data>
  <data key="d366">5678</data>
  <data key="d367">chapter</data>
  <data key="d368">cards/V04/B090.md</data>
  <data key="d264">Quattro canali di memoria consentono al loop di conservare conoscenza senza mantenere una sessione infinita.</data>
  <data key="d93">AGENTS.md, apprendimento cumulativo e strategie di iniezione del contesto organizzano stato operativo e conoscenza durevole.</data>
  <data key="d80">Accumulo non significa apprendimento corretto: servono provenienza, rimozione di lezioni errate e invalidazione quando cambia l’intenzione.</data>
  <data key="d369">T:System knowledge &amp; memory</data>
  <data key="d370">["T:System knowledge &amp; memory", "T:What agents can do", "T:Engineering structure", "T:Skills &amp; learning"]</data>
  <data key="d371">["K:Agent context and persistent memory", "K:System understanding and rationale", "K:Skills formation and teaching", "K:Cognitive offloading and skill debt"]</data>
  <data key="d372">["C:C09", "C:C10"]</data>
  <data key="d373">[{"level": "section", "title": "The Four Channels of Memory", "line": 18, "offset": 1557, "end": 1594}, {"level": "section", "title": "Building AGENTS.md", "line": 136, "offset": 10099, "end": 10127}, {"level": "section", "title": "Context Injection Strategies", "line": 420, "offset": 30296, "end": 30334}, {"level": "section", "title": "Memory Injection Technique", "line": 510, "offset": 38493, "end": 38529}]</data>
