<node id="B092">
  <data key="d73">Advanced Prompting for Autonomous Systems</data>
  <data key="d74">author_tex_section</data>
  <data key="d96">ND_INFORMATIONAL_TEX</data>
  <data key="d357">B</data>
  <data key="d358">V04</data>
  <data key="d363">Non-Deterministic Autonomous Coding Agents</data>
  <data key="d364">ai-auto_eng/AI_AUTO_ENG/chapters/chapter08_prompting.tex</data>
  <data key="d356">0449f462ab298c6f8c9d127bc0fc0f20f5d3aa027e78315d6a2fff9be98e4bda</data>
  <data key="d365">735</data>
  <data key="d366">4648</data>
  <data key="d367">chapter</data>
  <data key="d368">cards/V04/B092.md</data>
  <data key="d264">I prompt autonomi combinano chiarimento preventivo, vincoli stratificati e prospettive di revisione.</data>
  <data key="d93">Reverse prompting, constraint cascades, role stacking e self-critique diventano tecniche selezionabili in base al problema del task.</data>
  <data key="d80">Il punto critico è la correlazione dell’errore: chiedere al medesimo sistema di criticarsi può migliorare un candidato ma non costituisce prova indipendente.</data>
  <data key="d369">T:Engineering structure</data>
  <data key="d370">["T:Engineering structure", "T:Verification &amp; review", "T:What agents can do", "T:System knowledge &amp; memory"]</data>
  <data key="d371">["K:Specifications and governance", "K:Independent verification and oracles", "K:AI as reviewer", "K:Automation bias and trust", "K:Agent context and persistent memory", "K:System understanding and rationale", "K:Dependencies and agent supply chain"]</data>
  <data key="d372">["C:C04", "C:C07", "C:C09"]</data>
  <data key="d373">[{"level": "section", "title": "Reverse Prompting: Clarification Before Execution", "line": 26, "offset": 2248, "end": 2307}, {"level": "section", "title": "Role Stacking: Multiple Perspectives", "line": 284, "offset": 18183, "end": 18229}, {"level": "section", "title": "The Verification Loop: Self-Critique Patterns", "line": 393, "offset": 23908, "end": 23963}, {"level": "section", "title": "Putting It Together: Technique Selection", "line": 672, "offset": 35624, "end": 35674}]</data>
  <data key="d362">Enrico Papalini</data>
