<node id="B096">
  <data key="d73">Safety, Security, and Risk Management</data>
  <data key="d74">author_tex_section</data>
  <data key="d96">ND_INFORMATIONAL_TEX</data>
  <data key="d357">B</data>
  <data key="d358">V04</data>
  <data key="d363">Non-Deterministic Autonomous Coding Agents</data>
  <data key="d364">ai-auto_eng/AI_AUTO_ENG/chapters/chapter11_safety.tex</data>
  <data key="d356">ba3475482cee7bf1589b6b5bf5cdef2e6b0b5b87a3d264dffc5066762579d362</data>
  <data key="d365">744</data>
  <data key="d366">4753</data>
  <data key="d367">chapter</data>
  <data key="d368">cards/V04/B096.md</data>
  <data key="d264">La sicurezza dell’autonomia combina contenimento, limiti economici e una frontiera di revisione umana.</data>
  <data key="d93">Sandboxing, prevenzione di azioni distruttive, overbaking e gestione dei costi convergono in una checklist operativa.</data>
  <data key="d80">Una worktree isola modifiche Git, non processi, rete o credenziali. Le prescrizioni del volume non sono una certificazione della configurazione effettiva.</data>
  <data key="d369">T:Code quality &amp; security</data>
  <data key="d370">["T:Code quality &amp; security", "T:What agents can do", "T:Engineering structure", "T:Economics", "T:Productivity", "T:Verification &amp; review"]</data>
  <data key="d371">["K:Prompt injection and malicious tools", "K:Vulnerability and secure code", "K:Economic costs and return", "K:Output versus shipped value", "K:Review capacity and maintainers", "K:AI as reviewer", "K:Automation bias and trust"]</data>
  <data key="d372">["C:C06", "C:C08", "C:C12"]</data>
