<node id="B099">
  <data key="d73">Troubleshooting and Debugging</data>
  <data key="d74">author_tex_section</data>
  <data key="d96">ND_INFORMATIONAL_TEX</data>
  <data key="d357">B</data>
  <data key="d358">V04</data>
  <data key="d363">Non-Deterministic Autonomous Coding Agents</data>
  <data key="d364">ai-auto_eng/AI_AUTO_ENG/appendices/appendix_c_troubleshooting.tex</data>
  <data key="d356">5d46441c9f5b502515a9b7baa5fc59e303cdde7b809eeaee04e627c6d6000ca3</data>
  <data key="d365">1454</data>
  <data key="d366">5267</data>
  <data key="d367">appendix</data>
  <data key="d368">cards/V04/B099.md</data>
  <data key="d264">La diagnosi parte dai sintomi del loop e ricostruisce cause, stato e costi.</data>
  <data key="d93">Uscita precoce, mancato arresto, gate falliti, duplicazioni e consumi fuori controllo vengono collegati a log, Git, recupero e procedure d’emergenza.</data>
  <data key="d80">Le ricette diagnostiche sono proposte operative; l’efficacia e la sicurezza dei comandi dipendono dall’ambiente e non sono state provate qui.</data>
  <data key="d369">T:What agents can do</data>
  <data key="d370">["T:What agents can do", "T:Verification &amp; review", "T:Engineering structure", "T:Economics", "T:Productivity"]</data>
  <data key="d371">["K:Agent failure and escalation", "K:Evaluation methodology and baselines", "K:Long-running agent execution", "K:Independent verification and oracles", "K:Economic costs and return", "K:Output versus shipped value"]</data>
