<node id="B105">
  <data key="d73">The Organization Becomes a Loop</data>
  <data key="d74">author_tex_section</data>
  <data key="d96">ND_INFORMATIONAL_TEX</data>
  <data key="d357">B</data>
  <data key="d358">V05</data>
  <data key="d363">Non-Deterministic Loop Engineering</data>
  <data key="d364">NDLE/new_chapters/chapter02_organization.tex</data>
  <data key="d356">b8127eb334612ffa241bb6590f32fb0ac494bb4270e54bd9bd4f9ab6391f1f12</data>
  <data key="d365">818</data>
  <data key="d366">6092</data>
  <data key="d367">chapter</data>
  <data key="d368">cards/V05/B105.md</data>
  <data key="d264">L’organizzazione deve assegnare responsabilità, capacità di verifica e infrastruttura di conoscenza al lavoro dei loop.</data>
  <data key="d93">Ruoli, modelli operativi, metriche, governance nel runtime e roadmap di transizione descrivono come ridisegnare team e management.</data>
  <data key="d80">Le «cinque leggi» sono principi proposti, non leggi empiriche dimostrate; misurare handoff, capacità di revisione, mantenimento delle competenze e risultati di un pilot.</data>
  <data key="d369">T:Engineering structure</data>
  <data key="d370">["T:Engineering structure", "T:Verification &amp; review", "T:Jobs &amp; roles", "T:Skills &amp; learning", "T:System knowledge &amp; memory", "T:What agents can do", "T:Code quality &amp; security"]</data>
  <data key="d371">["K:Specifications and governance", "K:Ownership and knowledge transfer", "K:Employment and early-career roles", "K:Agent context and persistent memory", "K:System understanding and rationale", "K:Review capacity and maintainers", "K:AI as reviewer", "K:Automation bias and trust"]</data>
  <data key="d372">["C:C08", "C:C09", "C:C10", "C:C11"]</data>
  <data key="d373">[{"level": "section", "title": "From a New Tool to a New Institution", "line": 26, "offset": 3160, "end": 3206}, {"level": "section", "title": "Three Enterprise Operating Models", "line": 339, "offset": 20886, "end": 20929}, {"level": "section", "title": "The Workforce Impact: Rebundling, Not Simple Replacement", "line": 588, "offset": 32838, "end": 32904}, {"level": "section", "title": "The Leadership Paradox", "line": 759, "offset": 45921, "end": 45953}]</data>
  <data key="d362">Enrico Papalini</data>
  <data key="d82">Author-authored engineering synthesis, guidance or reference apparatus</data>
