<node id="B106">
  <data key="d73">The Economics of Loop Engineering</data>
  <data key="d74">author_tex_section</data>
  <data key="d96">ND_INFORMATIONAL_TEX</data>
  <data key="d357">B</data>
  <data key="d358">V05</data>
  <data key="d363">Non-Deterministic Loop Engineering</data>
  <data key="d364">NDLE/new_chapters/chapter03_economics.tex</data>
  <data key="d356">056669d326018cda56fff9a98d80302704953af32d4cbacf92673f89ad13d180</data>
  <data key="d365">1149</data>
  <data key="d366">6895</data>
  <data key="d367">chapter</data>
  <data key="d368">cards/V05/B106.md</data>
  <data key="d264">L’unità economica diventa l’esito verificato, non il token economico o la velocità del singolo contributore.</data>
  <data key="d93">Costi di esecuzione, verifica, rilavorazione e coordinamento sostengono scenari organizzativi e un caso di manutenzione in ambiente regolamentato.</data>
  <data key="d80">Scenari ed esempi analitici non sono contabilità produttiva misurata. Parametri di accettazione, tempi umani e perdite attese richiedono calibrazione indipendente.</data>
  <data key="d369">T:Economics</data>
  <data key="d370">["T:Economics", "T:Productivity", "T:Verification &amp; review", "T:Jobs &amp; roles", "T:Skills &amp; learning"]</data>
  <data key="d371">["K:Economic costs and return", "K:Output versus shipped value", "K:Evaluation methodology and baselines", "K:Controlled productivity evidence", "K:Employment and early-career roles", "K:Ownership and knowledge transfer"]</data>
  <data key="d372">["C:C02", "C:C11", "C:C12"]</data>
  <data key="d373">[{"level": "section", "title": "Introduction: From Cheap Assistance to Variable-Cost Production", "line": 12, "offset": 699, "end": 772}, {"level": "section", "title": "The Organization: Local Speed Is Not System Throughput", "line": 455, "offset": 22641, "end": 22705}, {"level": "section", "title": "Four Economic Failure Modes", "line": 836, "offset": 38279, "end": 38316}, {"level": "section", "title": "End-to-End Case Study: A Regulated Maintenance Loop", "line": 925, "offset": 45884, "end": 45945}]</data>
  <data key="d362">Enrico Papalini</data>
  <data key="d82">Author-authored engineering synthesis, guidance or reference apparatus</data>
