</node>
<node id="B107">
  <data key="d73">The Ralph Loop: Persistent Progress Through Fresh Context</data>
  <data key="d74">author_tex_section</data>
  <data key="d96">ND_INFORMATIONAL_TEX</data>
  <data key="d357">B</data>
  <data key="d358">V05</data>
  <data key="d363">Non-Deterministic Loop Engineering</data>
  <data key="d364">NDLE/new_chapters/chapter04_ralph_loop.tex</data>
  <data key="d356">aa58f0631ba2700b7664babd919b1e842cf17557b9d86fd374bab6fac5fc0636</data>
  <data key="d365">1324</data>
  <data key="d366">6157</data>
  <data key="d367">chapter</data>
  <data key="d368">cards/V05/B107.md</data>
  <data key="d264">Ralph conserva il progresso fuori dalla sessione e tratta la ripetizione come una politica limitata e verificabile.</data>
  <data key="d93">Il capitolo confronta loop Bash, stop hook e modalità manuale; aggiunge unità di lavoro, budget, escalation, manutenibilità e criteri di scelta.</data>
  <data key="d80">La persistenza non assicura convergenza; prova di completamento, autorizzazione e rollback devono risiedere fuori dalle dichiarazioni del worker.</data>
  <data key="d369">T:What agents can do</data>
  <data key="d370">["T:What agents can do", "T:Verification &amp; review", "T:Engineering structure", "T:System knowledge &amp; memory", "T:Code quality &amp; security"]</data>
  <data key="d371">["K:Long-running agent execution", "K:Agent failure and escalation", "K:Independent verification and oracles", "K:Agent context and persistent memory", "K:System understanding and rationale", "K:Prompt injection and malicious tools", "K:Vulnerability and secure code", "K:Architecture and modularity", "K:Technical debt and complexity"]</data>
  <data key="d372">["C:C03", "C:C05", "C:C06", "C:C07", "C:C09"]</data>
  <data key="d373">[{"level": "section", "title": "Why the Ralph Loop Matters", "line": 36, "offset": 2668, "end": 2704}, {"level": "section", "title": "Implementation Pattern II: The Stop-Hook Loop", "line": 545, "offset": 21272, "end": 21327}, {"level": "section", "title": "What Ralph Does Not Solve", "line": 1117, "offset": 38204, "end": 38239}, {"level": "section", "title": "Where the Minimal Loop Begins to Strain", "line": 1285, "offset": 46632, "end": 46681}]</data>
  <data key="d362">Enrico Papalini</data>
  <data key="d82">Author-authored engineering synthesis, guidance or reference apparatus</data>
  <data key="d374">File-level content mapping and citation-identity tracing; no independent validation or code execution</data>
  <data key="d375">NO</data>
