  <data key="d386">["\\textbf{Ralph connection:} This formalizes the context engineering discussed in \\chapref{ch:memory}. Huntley emphasizes: ``The more you use the context window, the worse the outcomes.'' This pattern provides a structured approach to what was previously intuition."]</data>
