  <data key="d356">3c88f9e5d7b0288e46de69503668ac80ecb7778165d80bf74eab10da30c4e2ba</data>
  <data key="d386">["\\textbf{Ralph connection:} Huntley's subagent management addresses this directly: ``only 1 subagent for build/tests'' while allowing many subagents for searching. The pattern generalizes this insight: explicitly control which tool patterns are encouraged versus discouraged through prompt instructions and quality metrics.", "\\section{Learning \\&amp; Adaptation Patterns}"]</data>
