<node id="F001">
  <data key="d73">The toolchain</data>
  <data key="d74">practitioner_essay</data>
  <data key="d357">F</data>
  <data key="d293">Birgitta Böckeler</data>
  <data key="d406">["Birgitta Böckeler"]</data>
  <data key="d173">2023-07-26</data>
  <data key="d407">Dated entry on the supplied series index; article date also used where printed</data>
  <data key="d226">https://martinfowler.com/articles/exploring-gen-ai/01-tool-landscape.html</data>
  <data key="d399">martinfowler.com</data>
  <data key="d408">Exploring Generative AI</data>
  <data key="d409">https://martinfowler.com/articles/exploring-gen-ai.html</data>
  <data key="d410">2026-10-13</data>
  <data key="d79">Organizes coding-assistance tools by task, interaction style, prompt construction and model or hosting choices. The framework helps separate what a tool does from how a developer supplies its context.</data>
