  <data key="d410">2026-10-13</data>
  <data key="d79">Repeats one representative change as a large Rust data-access module is refactored. Estimated input-token use falls after decomposition permits more selective code reading, connecting architecture to inference work.</data>
  <data key="d80">One application and change, approximate token counting and incomplete refactoring-cost accounting; this does not establish general ROI or savings for every future task.</data>
