  <data key="d409">https://martinfowler.com/articles/exploring-gen-ai.html</data>
  <data key="d410">2026-10-13</data>
  <data key="d79">Separates human-authored tests, a human review checkpoint and TDD entirely inside an agent loop. The small exploratory comparison found no clear advantage for fully internal TDD in model-judged quality or mutation scores.</data>
  <data key="d80">Small greenfield tasks, imperfect adherence and an LLM-defined quality rubric. Reported aggregate tokens include cache rereads and are not equivalent to billed cost; no universal conclusion about human-led TDD follows.</data>
  <data key="d82">Small exploratory agent evaluation</data>
  <data key="d169">Setup; results; test-first and red-green goals; costs; conclusions</data>
