  <data key="d410">2026-10-13</data>
  <data key="d79">In a simulated airline exercise, shared plans and frequent repository updates became an improvised coordination surface for agents. The account connects this behavior with the blackboard pattern and describes resulting CI pressure.</data>
  <data key="d80">A practice exercise, not a deployed airline system. The author explicitly questions reproducibility; the coordination mechanism was emergent rather than experimentally isolated.</data>
