  <data key="d409">https://martinfowler.com/articles/exploring-gen-ai.html</data>
  <data key="d410">2026-10-13</data>
  <data key="d79">Compares development with and without a behavioral harness against a separate acceptance suite. On the selected service, the stronger model passed both conditions; a cost-optimized model passed more consistently with harness feedback, at greater per-attempt effort.</data>
  <data key="d80">Ten paired runs per model on one unusually detailed greenfield Java brief. Guides and sensors changed together; estimated generation costs omit harness authoring, review and repairs. Final-gate-only use is proposed, not tested.</data>
  <data key="d82">Small repeated-run implementation experiment</data>
  <data key="d169">Experiment setup; independent outer evaluation; model comparisons; economics; boundaries</data>
