<edge source="B010" target="P085" id="ND-7b4b1b42dacf9bc2">
  <data key="d420">ND_EDITORIAL_COMPARISON</data>
  <data key="d423">Proposizione del file: L’adozione richiede una trasformazione di processi e competenze, non soltanto licenze. Confronto (adoption): Confrontare selezione degli strumenti, abilitazione del team e verifica degli esiti; una graduatoria o un piano di rollout non sostituisce un pilot controllato. Scheda P085: Interviews compare tool-selection practices across company sizes, including locally scored AI review trials and procurement constraints.</data>
  <data key="d424">ND.zip; editorial file-level mapping, 2026-10-11</data>
  <data key="d428">AI_SW_ENG/chapters_verbose/chapter08_v4.tex</data>
  <data key="d483">190</data>
  <data key="d467">EDITORIAL_NOT_EMPIRICAL_VALIDATION</data>
  <data key="d488">adoption</data>
  <data key="d489">Your 6-Month Roadmap (L190)</data>
  <data key="d490">Frozen v6 node P085 summary/contribution and limitation</data>
  <data key="d491">Company-local scoring exercises and tool selection are distinct from randomized productivity comparisons; evaluation samples and scoring scales are context-specific. Subscriber-only article remainder not reviewed. No microdata replication, controlled product test, or independent-rater agreement study was performed.</data>
  <data key="d492">NO</data>
  <data key="d493">NO</data>
  <data key="d458">EDITORIAL_ARGUMENTED_UNSCORED</data>
</edge>
<edge source="B010" target="W150" id="ND-b88a8d6811dcf0c0">
  <data key="d420">ND_EDITORIAL_COMPARISON</data>
  <data key="d423">Proposizione del file: L’adozione richiede una trasformazione di processi e competenze, non soltanto licenze. Confronto (governance): Confrontare autorità umana, confini decisionali e controlli di esecuzione; policy osservate e casi aziendali non certificano l’efficacia del metodo proposto. Scheda W150: Most policies allow AI while specifying disclosure and human responsibility, suggesting workable rather than absolutist governance.</data>
  <data key="d424">ND.zip; editorial file-level mapping, 2026-10-11</data>
  <data key="d428">AI_SW_ENG/chapters_verbose/chapter08_v4.tex</data>
  <data key="d483">15</data>
