<edge source="B013" target="W118" id="ND-e4285c68e7f4a466">
  <data key="d420">ND_EDITORIAL_COMPARISON</data>
  <data key="d423">Proposizione del file: Le pratiche di base uniscono specifica, test, piccoli passi, contesto e comprensione. Confronto (learning): Confrontare apprendimento, autonomia cognitiva e debito di competenza; il quiz immediato del corpus non valida retention ritardata o prestazione professionale di lungo periodo. Scheda W118: Access to AI can reduce independent conceptual learning even without faster task completion.</data>
  <data key="d424">ND.zip; editorial file-level mapping, 2026-10-11</data>
  <data key="d428">AI_SW_ENG/chapters_verbose/chapter07/chapter07_part1.tex</data>
  <data key="d483">1200</data>
  <data key="d467">EDITORIAL_NOT_EMPIRICAL_VALIDATION</data>
  <data key="d488">learning</data>
  <data key="d489">Pattern 8: Learning Loop Preservation (L1200); Learning Loop for Different Experience Levels (L1362)</data>
  <data key="d490">Frozen v6 node W118 summary/contribution and limitation</data>
  <data key="d491">Controlled learning quiz; not long-run professional performance. Immediate quiz only, not delayed retention. Source percentage normalization is unresolved; Figure 10.2 is qualitative. See Appendix B and ISSUE:V6:W118_NORMALIZATION.</data>
  <data key="d492">NO</data>
  <data key="d493">NO</data>
  <data key="d458">EDITORIAL_ARGUMENTED_UNSCORED</data>
</edge>
