  <data key="d489">Antipatterns: What Not to Do (L5)</data>
  <data key="d490">Frozen v6 node W154 summary/contribution and limitation</data>
  <data key="d491">Thematic self-reports from students, without effect-size or objective comprehension baseline.</data>
  <data key="d492">NO</data>
  <data key="d493">NO</data>
  <data key="d458">EDITORIAL_ARGUMENTED_UNSCORED</data>
</edge>
<edge source="B018" target="O017" id="ND-c28d8ef96ddabac5">
  <data key="d420">ND_EDITORIAL_COMPARISON</data>
  <data key="d423">Proposizione del file: Gli antipattern mostrano come velocità apparente e delega cieca erodano affidabilità e apprendimento. Confronto (debt): Esaminare il divario tra possesso del codice e comprensione del sistema; quota di codice generato e competenza del manutentore non sono equivalenti. Scheda O017: When agents implement most code, developers can accumulate comprehension debt even while shipping more changes.</data>
  <data key="d424">ND.zip; editorial file-level mapping, 2026-10-11</data>
  <data key="d428">AI_SW_ENG/chapters_verbose/chapter07/chapter07_antipatterns.tex</data>
