<edge source="B020" target="P085" id="ND-4cce1ff3bf9ff242">
  <data key="d420">ND_EDITORIAL_COMPARISON</data>
  <data key="d423">Proposizione del file: I livelli di maturità aiutano a distinguere esplorazione, prova e adozione. Confronto (adoption): Confrontare selezione degli strumenti, abilitazione del team e verifica degli esiti; una graduatoria o un piano di rollout non sostituisce un pilot controllato. Scheda P085: Interviews compare tool-selection practices across company sizes, including locally scored AI review trials and procurement constraints.</data>
  <data key="d424">ND.zip; editorial file-level mapping, 2026-10-11</data>
  <data key="d428">AI_SW_ENG/chapters_verbose/chapter10/01_maturity_levels.tex</data>
  <data key="d483">3</data>
  <data key="d467">EDITORIAL_NOT_EMPIRICAL_VALIDATION</data>
  <data key="d488">adoption</data>
  <data key="d489">Understanding Tool Maturity Levels (L3)</data>
  <data key="d490">Frozen v6 node P085 summary/contribution and limitation</data>
  <data key="d491">Company-local scoring exercises and tool selection are distinct from randomized productivity comparisons; evaluation samples and scoring scales are context-specific. Subscriber-only article remainder not reviewed. No microdata replication, controlled product test, or independent-rater agreement study was performed.</data>
  <data key="d492">NO</data>
  <data key="d493">NO</data>
  <data key="d458">EDITORIAL_ARGUMENTED_UNSCORED</data>
</edge>
<edge source="B020" target="W023" id="ND-972578d6677766be">
  <data key="d420">ND_EDITORIAL_COMPARISON</data>
  <data key="d423">Proposizione del file: I livelli di maturità aiutano a distinguere esplorazione, prova e adozione. Confronto (metrics): Usare disegno dello studio, baseline e segmentazione per leggere gli indicatori; risultati di un contesto non possono essere trasferiti automaticamente a tutti i team. Scheda W023: Experienced maintainers were approximately 19% slower on familiar real-repository tasks using early-2025 tools.</data>
  <data key="d424">ND.zip; editorial file-level mapping, 2026-10-11</data>
  <data key="d428">AI_SW_ENG/chapters_verbose/chapter10/01_maturity_levels.tex</data>
  <data key="d483">3</data>
  <data key="d467">EDITORIAL_NOT_EMPIRICAL_VALIDATION</data>
  <data key="d488">metrics</data>
  <data key="d489">Understanding Tool Maturity Levels (L3)</data>
  <data key="d490">Frozen v6 node W023 summary/contribution and limitation</data>
  <data key="d491">Small sample and older tool generation; not universal effect.</data>
  <data key="d492">NO</data>
  <data key="d493">NO</data>
  <data key="d458">EDITORIAL_ARGUMENTED_UNSCORED</data>
</edge>
<edge source="B020" target="O029" id="ND-d8ae3a6e2eb15e0c">
