<edge source="B029" target="W010" id="ND-b1157d01af972b94">
  <data key="d420">ND_EDITORIAL_COMPARISON</data>
  <data key="d423">Proposizione del file: Osservabilità e misura devono ricondurre i consumi al valore verificato. Confronto (productivity): Confrontare output generato, cambiamento integrato e valore rilasciato. Adozione e velocità percepita non misurano da sole produttività netta. Scheda W010: Agent advances raise commits substantially more than releases; delivery throughput has lower elasticity than coding throughput.</data>
  <data key="d424">ND.zip; editorial file-level mapping, 2026-10-11</data>
  <data key="d428">AI_SW_ENG/chapters_verbose/chapter10/10_measurement.tex</data>
  <data key="d483">2</data>
  <data key="d467">EDITORIAL_NOT_EMPIRICAL_VALIDATION</data>
  <data key="d488">productivity</data>
  <data key="d489">Measurement \&amp; Observability (L2); The measurement challenge with AI (L11); The answer: Multi-dimensional measurement (L21)</data>
  <data key="d490">Frozen v6 node W010 summary/contribution and limitation</data>
  <data key="d491">GitHub activity and matched designs do not establish business value.</data>
  <data key="d492">NO</data>
  <data key="d493">NO</data>
  <data key="d458">EDITORIAL_ARGUMENTED_UNSCORED</data>
</edge>
