<edge source="B029" target="P061" id="ND-0addcb2eb467b3a6">
  <data key="d420">ND_EDITORIAL_COMPARISON</data>
  <data key="d423">Proposizione del file: Osservabilità e misura devono ricondurre i consumi al valore verificato. Confronto (productivity): Confrontare output generato, cambiamento integrato e valore rilasciato. Adozione e velocità percepita non misurano da sole produttività netta. Scheda P061: Laura Tacho presents company measurement practices combining adoption, delivery, quality and developer experience, with baseline and segmentation guidance.</data>
  <data key="d424">ND.zip; editorial file-level mapping, 2026-10-11</data>
  <data key="d428">AI_SW_ENG/chapters_verbose/chapter10/10_measurement.tex</data>
  <data key="d483">2</data>
  <data key="d467">EDITORIAL_NOT_EMPIRICAL_VALIDATION</data>
  <data key="d488">productivity</data>
  <data key="d489">Measurement \&amp; Observability (L2); The measurement challenge with AI (L11); The answer: Multi-dimensional measurement (L21)</data>
  <data key="d490">Frozen v6 node P061 summary/contribution and limitation</data>
  <data key="d491">At publication Orosz disclosed investment in DX and Tacho was DX CTO; article states it was not sponsored. The source discloses Laura Tacho’s DX role and Orosz’s investment in DX. Company measurement practices are not a new randomized causal estimate. Public availability does not imply an independent check of every paragraph or chart. No microdata replication, controlled product test, or independent-rater agreement study was performed.</data>
  <data key="d492">NO</data>
  <data key="d493">NO</data>
  <data key="d458">EDITORIAL_ARGUMENTED_UNSCORED</data>
</edge>
<edge source="B029" target="W023" id="ND-598a99d01faf1dba">
  <data key="d420">ND_EDITORIAL_COMPARISON</data>
  <data key="d423">Proposizione del file: Osservabilità e misura devono ricondurre i consumi al valore verificato. Confronto (metrics): Usare disegno dello studio, baseline e segmentazione per leggere gli indicatori; risultati di un contesto non possono essere trasferiti automaticamente a tutti i team. Scheda W023: Experienced maintainers were approximately 19% slower on familiar real-repository tasks using early-2025 tools.</data>
  <data key="d424">ND.zip; editorial file-level mapping, 2026-10-11</data>
  <data key="d428">AI_SW_ENG/chapters_verbose/chapter10/10_measurement.tex</data>
  <data key="d483">2</data>
  <data key="d467">EDITORIAL_NOT_EMPIRICAL_VALIDATION</data>
  <data key="d488">metrics</data>
  <data key="d489">Measurement \&amp; Observability (L2); The measurement challenge with AI (L11); The answer: Multi-dimensional measurement (L21)</data>
  <data key="d490">Frozen v6 node W023 summary/contribution and limitation</data>
  <data key="d491">Small sample and older tool generation; not universal effect.</data>
  <data key="d492">NO</data>
  <data key="d493">NO</data>
  <data key="d458">EDITORIAL_ARGUMENTED_UNSCORED</data>
</edge>
