<edge source="B030" target="W071" id="ND-50505c8dfb13c9fa">
  <data key="d420">ND_EDITORIAL_COMPARISON</data>
  <data key="d423">Proposizione del file: Gli errori ricorrenti di adozione vanno diagnosticati prima di aggiungere strumenti. Confronto (failures): Separare errori del candidato, del contesto, della verifica e del workflow prima di applicare un nuovo tentativo o aumentare l’autonomia. Scheda W071: Rejection categories include agent failure, project workflow mismatch and unspecified reasons; distinguish causes before retrying.</data>
  <data key="d424">ND.zip; editorial file-level mapping, 2026-10-11</data>
  <data key="d428">AI_SW_ENG/chapters_verbose/chapter10/11_pitfalls.tex</data>
  <data key="d483">313</data>
  <data key="d467">EDITORIAL_NOT_EMPIRICAL_VALIDATION</data>
  <data key="d488">failures</data>
  <data key="d489">Why it fails in practice (L313)</data>
  <data key="d490">Frozen v6 node W071 summary/contribution and limitation</data>
  <data key="d491">Explanations may be inferred from inconsistent PR records; shared AIDev data.</data>
  <data key="d492">NO</data>
  <data key="d493">NO</data>
  <data key="d458">EDITORIAL_ARGUMENTED_UNSCORED</data>
</edge>
<edge source="B030" target="O006" id="ND-70dc85ffcc5144e0">
  <data key="d420">ND_EDITORIAL_COMPARISON</data>
  <data key="d423">Proposizione del file: Gli errori ricorrenti di adozione vanno diagnosticati prima di aggiungere strumenti. Confronto (failures): Separare errori del candidato, del contesto, della verifica e del workflow prima di applicare un nuovo tentativo o aumentare l’autonomia. Scheda O006: Effective autonomous loops begin with bounded goals, observable checks and explicit stopping rules.</data>
  <data key="d424">ND.zip; editorial file-level mapping, 2026-10-11</data>
  <data key="d428">AI_SW_ENG/chapters_verbose/chapter10/11_pitfalls.tex</data>
