<edge source="B031" target="P085" id="ND-c30bb2dad04d322a">
  <data key="d420">ND_EDITORIAL_COMPARISON</data>
  <data key="d423">Proposizione del file: Un pilot di novanta giorni deve partire da baseline e concludersi con una decisione motivata. Confronto (adoption): Confrontare selezione degli strumenti, abilitazione del team e verifica degli esiti; una graduatoria o un piano di rollout non sostituisce un pilot controllato. Scheda P085: Interviews compare tool-selection practices across company sizes, including locally scored AI review trials and procurement constraints.</data>
  <data key="d424">ND.zip; editorial file-level mapping, 2026-10-11</data>
  <data key="d428">AI_SW_ENG/chapters_verbose/chapter10/12_roadmap.tex</data>
  <data key="d483">2</data>
  <data key="d467">EDITORIAL_NOT_EMPIRICAL_VALIDATION</data>
  <data key="d488">adoption</data>
  <data key="d489">First 90-Days Implementation Roadmap (L2); Week 1: Security and Context Engineering (Before Tools) (L60); Week 2: Tool Selection and Installation (L105)</data>
  <data key="d490">Frozen v6 node P085 summary/contribution and limitation</data>
  <data key="d491">Company-local scoring exercises and tool selection are distinct from randomized productivity comparisons; evaluation samples and scoring scales are context-specific. Subscriber-only article remainder not reviewed. No microdata replication, controlled product test, or independent-rater agreement study was performed.</data>
  <data key="d492">NO</data>
  <data key="d493">NO</data>
  <data key="d458">EDITORIAL_ARGUMENTED_UNSCORED</data>
</edge>
<edge source="B031" target="W023" id="ND-b7bf97fc1b77eb3a">
  <data key="d420">ND_EDITORIAL_COMPARISON</data>
  <data key="d423">Proposizione del file: Un pilot di novanta giorni deve partire da baseline e concludersi con una decisione motivata. Confronto (metrics): Usare disegno dello studio, baseline e segmentazione per leggere gli indicatori; risultati di un contesto non possono essere trasferiti automaticamente a tutti i team. Scheda W023: Experienced maintainers were approximately 19% slower on familiar real-repository tasks using early-2025 tools.</data>
  <data key="d424">ND.zip; editorial file-level mapping, 2026-10-11</data>
  <data key="d428">AI_SW_ENG/chapters_verbose/chapter10/12_roadmap.tex</data>
