<edge source="B034" target="P070" id="ND-d3305400572bb1c7">
  <data key="d420">ND_EDITORIAL_COMPARISON</data>
  <data key="d423">Proposizione del file: Le soluzioni operative traducono i workflow in profili di agenti, handoff ed esercizi. Confronto (orchestration): Confrontare parallelismo degli agenti, coordinamento e capacità di revisione; il guadagno teorico di concorrenza va ridotto per handoff e integrazione. Scheda P070: Discusses concurrent coding-agent workflows through practitioner accounts, contrasting parallel task execution with the serial attention needed to review and land changes.</data>
  <data key="d424">ND.zip; editorial file-level mapping, 2026-10-11</data>
  <data key="d428">AI_SW_ENG/appendices/appendix_c_v4.tex</data>
  <data key="d483">227</data>
  <data key="d467">EDITORIAL_NOT_EMPIRICAL_VALIDATION</data>
  <data key="d488">orchestration</data>
  <data key="d489">Complete Example: Planner Agent (L227); Chapter ch:tools-n-pratices , Section sec:multi-agent : Your First Multi-Agent Workflow (L1428)</data>
  <data key="d490">Frozen v6 node P070 summary/contribution and limitation</data>
  <data key="d491">Excerpt of Pulse #149; shares that issue, not the content of the separate interview-comparison article. This non-Pulse-titled blog article is an excerpt of a Pulse issue originally published 2025-10-09. It passes the literal title-prefix rule; it is excluded by the optional stricter Pulse-origin filter. The parent issue is provenance only, not another P article. The public account explicitly reuses the Sid Bidasaria conversation reported in P062. It is a different article, not independent interview evidence. Public availability does not imply an independent check of every paragraph or chart. No microdata replication, controlled product test, or independent-rater agreement study was performed.</data>
  <data key="d492">NO</data>
  <data key="d493">NO</data>
  <data key="d458">EDITORIAL_ARGUMENTED_UNSCORED</data>
</edge>
<edge source="B034" target="W157" id="ND-6f75e9ebc67c6b38">
  <data key="d420">ND_EDITORIAL_COMPARISON</data>
  <data key="d423">Proposizione del file: Le soluzioni operative traducono i workflow in profili di agenti, handoff ed esercizi. Confronto (context): Confrontare selezione, recupero e gestione del contesto con i confini di fiducia dei dati esterni. Scheda W157: Typed state pages and enforced write policy protect essential agent memory against compaction and reset failures.</data>
  <data key="d424">ND.zip; editorial file-level mapping, 2026-10-11</data>
  <data key="d428">AI_SW_ENG/appendices/appendix_c_v4.tex</data>
