<edge source="B035" target="P098" id="ND-3cbcb29e01602d7e">
  <data key="d420">ND_EDITORIAL_COMPARISON</data>
  <data key="d423">Proposizione del file: L’adozione europea combina responsabilità, provenienza e scelte di sovranità operativa. Confronto (law): Usare il confronto soltanto per governance, provenienza e scelta infrastrutturale; nessuna di queste associazioni convalida affermazioni giuridiche del volume. Scheda P098: Orosz introduces authorized excerpts by Martin Kleppmann and Chris Riccomini on cloud versus self-hosting and engineers’ ethical responsibilities.</data>
  <data key="d424">ND.zip; editorial file-level mapping, 2026-10-11</data>
  <data key="d428">AI_SW_ENG/appendices/appendix_eu.tex</data>
  <data key="d483">53</data>
  <data key="d467">EDITORIAL_NOT_EMPIRICAL_VALIDATION</data>
  <data key="d488">law</data>
  <data key="d489">The Regulatory Landscape: Three Critical Frameworks (L53); The EU Copyright Directive's TDM Exceptions (L150); Adaptation Strategies for EU Companies (L245)</data>
  <data key="d490">Frozen v6 node P098 summary/contribution and limitation</data>
  <data key="d491">Displayed byline: Gergely Orosz. Excerpt authors: Martin Kleppmann and Chris Riccomini. Public availability does not imply an independent check of every paragraph or chart. No microdata replication, controlled product test, or independent-rater agreement study was performed.</data>
  <data key="d492">NO</data>
