<edge source="B050" target="B039" id="ND-4724aac0f9b980ee">
  <data key="d420">ND_REWORKS_EARLIER_TREATMENT</data>
  <data key="d423">La sequenza di processo viene precisata in quattro fasi e quattro gate. Ancoraggi sorgente: Four Phases, Four Gates (L22); The Refinement Stack (L157); Consistency Analysis (L199); Common Failure Modes by Phase (L276). Destinazione: Four Phases, Four Gates (L20); Model Selection Strategy (L241); The Clarification Phase (L361); Quality Checklists: Unit Tests for English (L467)</data>
  <data key="d424">ND.zip; editorial file-level mapping, 2026-10-11</data>
