  <data key="d420">ND_SHARED_METHOD_DIFFERENT_SCOPE</data>
  <data key="d423">Descrizione comparativa degli strumenti autonomi e spiegazione estesa del medesimo pattern Ralph; nessuna cronologia inferita. Ancoraggi sorgente: The Autonomy Spectrum (L20); Karpathy-Inspired Skills --- Behavioral Discipline (L257); AIDD --- Architecture-Decision-Driven Backend Pipeline (L426); Lessons for Your Practice (L581). Destinazione: Anatomy of a Ralph Loop (L20); Implementation Options (L328); Your First Ralph Loop (L416); Troubleshooting Common Issues (L650)</data>
