<edge source="B057" target="T:Engineering structure" id="ND-1df4f4557716f9c1">
  <data key="d420">ND_PRIMARY_STREAM</data>
  <data key="d423">Dodici dimensioni rendono espliciti convergenze e disaccordi fra framework. Ancoraggi: The Twelve Core Comparison Dimensions (L20); Strategic Maps: Three Magic Quadrants (L171); Thematic Deep-Dives (L429); The Divergence Map: Four Irreducible Philosophical Splits (L575)</data>
