<edge source="B070" target="W150" id="ND-48fb604497d419bb">
  <data key="d420">ND_EDITORIAL_COMPARISON</data>
  <data key="d423">Proposizione del file: La reference card di Enterprise SDD condensa pipeline, agenti, comandi e gate. Confronto (governance): Confrontare autorità umana, confini decisionali e controlli di esecuzione; policy osservate e casi aziendali non certificano l’efficacia del metodo proposto. Scheda W150: Most policies allow AI while specifying disclosure and human responsibility, suggesting workable rather than absolutist governance.</data>
  <data key="d424">ND.zip; editorial file-level mapping, 2026-10-11</data>
  <data key="d428">AI_SDD_ENG_V2/appendices/reference_cards/appendix_enterprise_sdd.tex</data>
  <data key="d483">4</data>
  <data key="d467">EDITORIAL_NOT_EMPIRICAL_VALIDATION</data>
  <data key="d488">governance</data>
  <data key="d489">Enterprise SDD (L4)</data>
  <data key="d490">Frozen v6 node W150 summary/contribution and limitation</data>
  <data key="d491">Classifies rules but does not measure their safety effect.</data>
  <data key="d492">NO</data>
  <data key="d493">NO</data>
  <data key="d458">EDITORIAL_ARGUMENTED_UNSCORED</data>
</edge>
<edge source="B070" target="O009" id="ND-d33498152eae151e">
  <data key="d420">ND_EDITORIAL_COMPARISON</data>
  <data key="d423">Proposizione del file: La reference card di Enterprise SDD condensa pipeline, agenti, comandi e gate. Confronto (governance): Confrontare autorità umana, confini decisionali e controlli di esecuzione; policy osservate e casi aziendali non certificano l’efficacia del metodo proposto. Scheda O009: Engineers can delegate the inner execution loop while retaining ownership of quality criteria, verdicts and consequences.</data>
  <data key="d424">ND.zip; editorial file-level mapping, 2026-10-11</data>
  <data key="d428">AI_SDD_ENG_V2/appendices/reference_cards/appendix_enterprise_sdd.tex</data>
