</edge>
<edge source="B070" target="P119" id="ND-95da06da3e75c938">
  <data key="d420">ND_EDITORIAL_COMPARISON</data>
  <data key="d423">Proposizione del file: La reference card di Enterprise SDD condensa pipeline, agenti, comandi e gate. Confronto (governance): Confrontare autorità umana, confini decisionali e controlli di esecuzione; policy osservate e casi aziendali non certificano l’efficacia del metodo proposto. Scheda P119: A company-visit report describes Codex adoption, internal integrations and feedback loops extending into performance work and infrastructure.</data>
  <data key="d424">ND.zip; editorial file-level mapping, 2026-10-11</data>
  <data key="d428">AI_SDD_ENG_V2/appendices/reference_cards/appendix_enterprise_sdd.tex</data>
  <data key="d483">4</data>
  <data key="d467">EDITORIAL_NOT_EMPIRICAL_VALIDATION</data>
  <data key="d488">governance</data>
  <data key="d489">Enterprise SDD (L4)</data>
  <data key="d490">Frozen v6 node P119 summary/contribution and limitation</data>
  <data key="d491">Internal integrations, selected interviewees and unusually permissive token budgets limit transfer to other organizations. Subscriber-only article remainder not reviewed. No microdata replication, controlled product test, or independent-rater agreement study was performed.</data>
  <data key="d492">NO</data>
  <data key="d493">NO</data>
  <data key="d458">EDITORIAL_ARGUMENTED_UNSCORED</data>
</edge>
<edge source="B070" target="W191" id="ND-e995ea94bda8f3e7">
  <data key="d420">ND_EDITORIAL_COMPARISON</data>
  <data key="d423">Proposizione del file: La reference card di Enterprise SDD condensa pipeline, agenti, comandi e gate. Confronto (autonomy): Confrontare delega, arresto ed escalation. Le scale practitioner descrivono regimi di lavoro, non una misura validata e universale della maturità. Scheda W191: Rejected agent PRs reveal recurring limits in requirement understanding, repository fit and coordination with maintainers.</data>
  <data key="d424">ND.zip; editorial file-level mapping, 2026-10-11</data>
  <data key="d428">AI_SDD_ENG_V2/appendices/reference_cards/appendix_enterprise_sdd.tex</data>
