<edge source="B073" target="W002" id="ND-50ace134cd16cace">
  <data key="d420">ND_EDITORIAL_COMPARISON</data>
  <data key="d423">Proposizione del file: La reference card di BMAD evidenzia agenti persona e artefatti per fase. Confronto (orchestration): Confrontare parallelismo degli agenti, coordinamento e capacità di revisione; il guadagno teorico di concorrenza va ridotto per handoff e integrazione. Scheda W002: Delegating to an agent enables tasks beyond copilot assistance; lack of visibility constrains trust.</data>
  <data key="d424">ND.zip; editorial file-level mapping, 2026-10-11</data>
  <data key="d428">AI_SDD_ENG_V2/appendices/reference_cards/appendix_bmad.tex</data>
  <data key="d483">4</data>
  <data key="d467">EDITORIAL_NOT_EMPIRICAL_VALIDATION</data>
  <data key="d488">orchestration</data>
  <data key="d489">BMAD Method (L4)</data>
  <data key="d490">Frozen v6 node W002 summary/contribution and limitation</data>
  <data key="d491">Twenty students; completion-time effects unspecified.</data>
  <data key="d492">NO</data>
  <data key="d493">NO</data>
  <data key="d458">EDITORIAL_ARGUMENTED_UNSCORED</data>
</edge>
<edge source="B073" target="O025" id="ND-13aa9c240d6c14da">
  <data key="d420">ND_EDITORIAL_COMPARISON</data>
  <data key="d423">Proposizione del file: La reference card di BMAD evidenzia agenti persona e artefatti per fase. Confronto (orchestration): Confrontare parallelismo degli agenti, coordinamento e capacità di revisione; il guadagno teorico di concorrenza va ridotto per handoff e integrazione. Scheda O025: Developers are moving from guiding one agent toward coordinating multiple asynchronously executing agents.</data>
  <data key="d424">ND.zip; editorial file-level mapping, 2026-10-11</data>
  <data key="d428">AI_SDD_ENG_V2/appendices/reference_cards/appendix_bmad.tex</data>
  <data key="d483">4</data>
  <data key="d467">EDITORIAL_NOT_EMPIRICAL_VALIDATION</data>
  <data key="d488">orchestration</data>
  <data key="d489">BMAD Method (L4)</data>
  <data key="d490">Frozen v6 node O025 summary/contribution and limitation</data>
  <data key="d491">Role forecasts and workflow examples, not validated hiring or productivity outcomes.</data>
  <data key="d492">NO</data>
  <data key="d493">NO</data>
  <data key="d458">EDITORIAL_ARGUMENTED_UNSCORED</data>
</edge>
<edge source="B073" target="P070" id="ND-538b049cac793c4f">
  <data key="d420">ND_EDITORIAL_COMPARISON</data>
  <data key="d423">Proposizione del file: La reference card di BMAD evidenzia agenti persona e artefatti per fase. Confronto (orchestration): Confrontare parallelismo degli agenti, coordinamento e capacità di revisione; il guadagno teorico di concorrenza va ridotto per handoff e integrazione. Scheda P070: Discusses concurrent coding-agent workflows through practitioner accounts, contrasting parallel task execution with the serial attention needed to review and land changes.</data>
  <data key="d424">ND.zip; editorial file-level mapping, 2026-10-11</data>
  <data key="d428">AI_SDD_ENG_V2/appendices/reference_cards/appendix_bmad.tex</data>
  <data key="d483">4</data>
  <data key="d467">EDITORIAL_NOT_EMPIRICAL_VALIDATION</data>
  <data key="d488">orchestration</data>
  <data key="d489">BMAD Method (L4)</data>
  <data key="d490">Frozen v6 node P070 summary/contribution and limitation</data>
  <data key="d491">Excerpt of Pulse #149; shares that issue, not the content of the separate interview-comparison article. This non-Pulse-titled blog article is an excerpt of a Pulse issue originally published 2025-10-09. It passes the literal title-prefix rule; it is excluded by the optional stricter Pulse-origin filter. The parent issue is provenance only, not another P article. The public account explicitly reuses the Sid Bidasaria conversation reported in P062. It is a different article, not independent interview evidence. Public availability does not imply an independent check of every paragraph or chart. No microdata replication, controlled product test, or independent-rater agreement study was performed.</data>
  <data key="d492">NO</data>
  <data key="d493">NO</data>
  <data key="d458">EDITORIAL_ARGUMENTED_UNSCORED</data>
</edge>
<edge source="B073" target="W011" id="ND-f565d4761332299c">
  <data key="d420">ND_EDITORIAL_COMPARISON</data>
  <data key="d423">Proposizione del file: La reference card di BMAD evidenzia agenti persona e artefatti per fase. Confronto (intent): Confrontare intenti, specifiche e criteri di accettazione. La convergenza concettuale non costituisce una validazione sperimentale del processo. Scheda W011: Proposes specification and verification governance to balance faster generation against reliability.</data>
  <data key="d424">ND.zip; editorial file-level mapping, 2026-10-11</data>
  <data key="d428">AI_SDD_ENG_V2/appendices/reference_cards/appendix_bmad.tex</data>
  <data key="d483">4</data>
  <data key="d467">EDITORIAL_NOT_EMPIRICAL_VALIDATION</data>
  <data key="d488">intent</data>
  <data key="d489">BMAD Method (L4)</data>
  <data key="d490">Frozen v6 node W011 summary/contribution and limitation</data>
  <data key="d491">Synthesis rather than a new intervention trial.</data>
  <data key="d492">NO</data>
  <data key="d493">NO</data>
  <data key="d458">EDITORIAL_ARGUMENTED_UNSCORED</data>
</edge>
<edge source="B073" target="O018" id="ND-753b368dde189111">
  <data key="d420">ND_EDITORIAL_COMPARISON</data>
  <data key="d423">Proposizione del file: La reference card di BMAD evidenzia agenti persona e artefatti per fase. Confronto (intent): Confrontare intenti, specifiche e criteri di accettazione. La convergenza concettuale non costituisce una validazione sperimentale del processo. Scheda O018: A useful agent specification is compact, testable and iterative rather than a giant prompt resembling an unvalidated requirements dump.</data>
  <data key="d424">ND.zip; editorial file-level mapping, 2026-10-11</data>
  <data key="d428">AI_SDD_ENG_V2/appendices/reference_cards/appendix_bmad.tex</data>
  <data key="d483">4</data>
