  <data key="d489">ralph-copilot (L4)</data>
  <data key="d490">Frozen v6 node O012 summary/contribution and limitation</data>
  <data key="d491">A practitioner engineering pattern; the article does not establish comparative loop reliability by controlled experiment.</data>
  <data key="d492">NO</data>
  <data key="d493">NO</data>
  <data key="d458">EDITORIAL_ARGUMENTED_UNSCORED</data>
</edge>
<edge source="B075" target="P110" id="ND-853c57fa924f419e">
  <data key="d420">ND_EDITORIAL_COMPARISON</data>
  <data key="d423">Proposizione del file: La reference card di ralph-copilot concentra il loop in ruoli e memoria su file. Confronto (loop): Confrontare il loop come unità di lavoro, con stato, controlli e policy esterni. I tre corpus non costituiscono repliche indipendenti dello stesso risultato. Scheda P110: Orosz traces Ralph-style loops, scheduled triggers and goal-oriented harness features.</data>
  <data key="d424">ND.zip; editorial file-level mapping, 2026-10-11</data>
  <data key="d428">AI_SDD_ENG_V2/appendices/reference_cards/appendix_ralph.tex</data>
  <data key="d483">4</data>
  <data key="d467">EDITORIAL_NOT_EMPIRICAL_VALIDATION</data>
  <data key="d488">loop</data>
  <data key="d489">ralph-copilot (L4)</data>
  <data key="d490">Frozen v6 node P110 summary/contribution and limitation</data>
  <data key="d491">P110 directly links https://addyosmani.com/blog/loop-engineering/ (7 June 2026). O012 catalogues the substantially matching Substack edition (8 June 2026). Treat the edge as discussion of the same underlying work via an alternate edition, not an exact-URL citation. The paid remainder and comparative loop outcomes remain unreviewed. Subscriber-only article remainder not reviewed. No microdata replication, controlled product test, or independent-rater agreement study was performed.</data>
  <data key="d492">NO</data>
  <data key="d493">NO</data>
  <data key="d458">EDITORIAL_ARGUMENTED_UNSCORED</data>
</edge>
<edge source="B075" target="W159" id="ND-594f82c59011cd84">
  <data key="d420">ND_EDITORIAL_COMPARISON</data>
  <data key="d423">Proposizione del file: La reference card di ralph-copilot concentra il loop in ruoli e memoria su file. Confronto (memory): Mettere a confronto continuità del contesto, stato persistente e aggiornamento della conoscenza; una memoria più ampia non è di per sé una memoria corretta. Scheda W159: Hybrid episodic and semantic storage with retention policies can improve long-horizon consistency and token efficiency.</data>
  <data key="d424">ND.zip; editorial file-level mapping, 2026-10-11</data>
