<edge source="B076" target="O012" id="ND-8b28c8900b2918fc">
  <data key="d420">ND_EDITORIAL_COMPARISON</data>
  <data key="d423">Proposizione del file: La reference card di Spec Loop Engine separa executor e verifier su uno stato durevole. Confronto (loop): Confrontare il loop come unità di lavoro, con stato, controlli e policy esterni. I tre corpus non costituiscono repliche indipendenti dello stesso risultato. Scheda O012: Osmani identifies five interoperable loop-building primitives—scheduling, worktrees, skills, connectors and subagents—plus durable external memory.</data>
  <data key="d424">ND.zip; editorial file-level mapping, 2026-10-11</data>
  <data key="d428">AI_SDD_ENG_V2/appendices/reference_cards/appendix_specloop.tex</data>
  <data key="d483">4</data>
  <data key="d467">EDITORIAL_NOT_EMPIRICAL_VALIDATION</data>
  <data key="d488">loop</data>
  <data key="d489">Spec Loop Engine (L4)</data>
  <data key="d490">Frozen v6 node O012 summary/contribution and limitation</data>
  <data key="d491">A practitioner engineering pattern; the article does not establish comparative loop reliability by controlled experiment.</data>
  <data key="d492">NO</data>
  <data key="d493">NO</data>
  <data key="d458">EDITORIAL_ARGUMENTED_UNSCORED</data>
</edge>
<edge source="B076" target="P110" id="ND-23b79871af6437e7">
  <data key="d420">ND_EDITORIAL_COMPARISON</data>
  <data key="d423">Proposizione del file: La reference card di Spec Loop Engine separa executor e verifier su uno stato durevole. Confronto (loop): Confrontare il loop come unità di lavoro, con stato, controlli e policy esterni. I tre corpus non costituiscono repliche indipendenti dello stesso risultato. Scheda P110: Orosz traces Ralph-style loops, scheduled triggers and goal-oriented harness features.</data>
  <data key="d424">ND.zip; editorial file-level mapping, 2026-10-11</data>
  <data key="d428">AI_SDD_ENG_V2/appendices/reference_cards/appendix_specloop.tex</data>
  <data key="d483">4</data>
  <data key="d467">EDITORIAL_NOT_EMPIRICAL_VALIDATION</data>
  <data key="d488">loop</data>
  <data key="d489">Spec Loop Engine (L4)</data>
  <data key="d490">Frozen v6 node P110 summary/contribution and limitation</data>
  <data key="d491">P110 directly links https://addyosmani.com/blog/loop-engineering/ (7 June 2026). O012 catalogues the substantially matching Substack edition (8 June 2026). Treat the edge as discussion of the same underlying work via an alternate edition, not an exact-URL citation. The paid remainder and comparative loop outcomes remain unreviewed. Subscriber-only article remainder not reviewed. No microdata replication, controlled product test, or independent-rater agreement study was performed.</data>
  <data key="d492">NO</data>
  <data key="d493">NO</data>
  <data key="d458">EDITORIAL_ARGUMENTED_UNSCORED</data>
</edge>
<edge source="B076" target="W077" id="ND-f67d51cf7d5559f2">
  <data key="d420">ND_EDITORIAL_COMPARISON</data>
  <data key="d423">Proposizione del file: La reference card di Spec Loop Engine separa executor e verifier su uno stato durevole. Confronto (oracle): Distinguere test derivati dall’intenzione da test che ripetono l’implementazione; un esito verde richiede un oracolo pertinente e sufficientemente indipendente. Scheda W077: Tests generated directly from defective implementations can encode the bug; an independent specification reduces error propagation.</data>
  <data key="d424">ND.zip; editorial file-level mapping, 2026-10-11</data>
  <data key="d428">AI_SDD_ENG_V2/appendices/reference_cards/appendix_specloop.tex</data>
