<edge source="B087" target="P086" id="ND-17d03523d4e084f0">
  <data key="d420">ND_EDITORIAL_COMPARISON</data>
  <data key="d423">Proposizione del file: Il modello a nove stadi rende discutibili competenze e prerequisiti della delega agli agenti. Confronto (autonomy): Confrontare delega, arresto ed escalation. Le scale practitioner descrivono regimi di lavoro, non una misura validata e universale della maturità. Scheda P086: A written interview explores Yegge’s autonomy ladder, multi-agent work, fatigue and predictions about engineering employment.</data>
  <data key="d424">ND.zip; editorial file-level mapping, 2026-10-11</data>
  <data key="d428">ai-auto_eng/AI_AUTO_ENG/chapters/chapter03_evolution.tex</data>
  <data key="d483">217</data>
  <data key="d467">EDITORIAL_NOT_EMPIRICAL_VALIDATION</data>
  <data key="d488">autonomy</data>
  <data key="d489">Team Readiness Indicators (L217); What You Need Before Attempting Autonomous Loops (L341)</data>
  <data key="d490">Frozen v6 node P086 summary/contribution and limitation</data>
  <data key="d491">Yegge’s eight stages are a provocative practitioner ladder, not a validated maturity scale and not Osmani’s independent agency/orchestration axes. Subscriber-only article remainder not reviewed. No microdata replication, controlled product test, or independent-rater agreement study was performed.</data>
  <data key="d492">NO</data>
  <data key="d493">NO</data>
  <data key="d458">EDITORIAL_ARGUMENTED_UNSCORED</data>
</edge>
<edge source="B087" target="W118" id="ND-96d9fb7ea7aa3081">
  <data key="d420">ND_EDITORIAL_COMPARISON</data>
  <data key="d423">Proposizione del file: Il modello a nove stadi rende discutibili competenze e prerequisiti della delega agli agenti. Confronto (learning): Confrontare apprendimento, autonomia cognitiva e debito di competenza; il quiz immediato del corpus non valida retention ritardata o prestazione professionale di lungo periodo. Scheda W118: Access to AI can reduce independent conceptual learning even without faster task completion.</data>
  <data key="d424">ND.zip; editorial file-level mapping, 2026-10-11</data>
  <data key="d428">ai-auto_eng/AI_AUTO_ENG/chapters/chapter03_evolution.tex</data>
  <data key="d483">80</data>
