<edge source="B090" target="P090" id="ND-3c03bf7e652c5bd4">
  <data key="d420">ND_EDITORIAL_COMPARISON</data>
  <data key="d423">Proposizione del file: Quattro canali di memoria consentono al loop di conservare conoscenza senza mantenere una sessione infinita. Confronto (memory): Mettere a confronto continuità del contesto, stato persistente e aggiornamento della conoscenza; una memoria più ampia non è di per sé una memoria corretta. Scheda P090: An industry case describes Uber’s AI development platform, shared context, internal agents and review-related tooling.</data>
  <data key="d424">ND.zip; editorial file-level mapping, 2026-10-11</data>
  <data key="d428">ai-auto_eng/AI_AUTO_ENG/chapters/chapter06_memory.tex</data>
  <data key="d483">18</data>
  <data key="d467">EDITORIAL_NOT_EMPIRICAL_VALIDATION</data>
  <data key="d488">memory</data>
  <data key="d489">The Four Channels of Memory (L18); Task State (prd.json) (L115); Creating Institutional Memory (L399)</data>
  <data key="d490">Frozen v6 node P090 summary/contribution and limitation</data>
  <data key="d491">Original publication March 10; updated March 11. Reported adoption percentages use different denominators. Author discloses former employment at Uber. The source’s correction distinguishes 84% agentic-tool adoption from 65–72% IDE code-generation figures and CLI-specific measures; those denominators must not be interchanged. An author correction in the March 12, 2026 Pulse distinguishes the IDE-generated-code share from an earlier erroneous percentage. Original date, updated text and company-level denominators remain separate. Subscriber-only article remainder not reviewed. No microdata replication, controlled product test, or independent-rater agreement study was performed.</data>
  <data key="d492">NO</data>
  <data key="d493">NO</data>
  <data key="d458">EDITORIAL_ARGUMENTED_UNSCORED</data>
</edge>
<edge source="B090" target="W157" id="ND-9b42b7ba18535253">
  <data key="d420">ND_EDITORIAL_COMPARISON</data>
  <data key="d423">Proposizione del file: Quattro canali di memoria consentono al loop di conservare conoscenza senza mantenere una sessione infinita. Confronto (static): Confrontare file di istruzioni, memoria esterna e responsabilità di aggiornamento; i meccanismi descritti non sono tutti equivalenti alla memoria virtuale gestita dal sistema. Scheda W157: Typed state pages and enforced write policy protect essential agent memory against compaction and reset failures.</data>
  <data key="d424">ND.zip; editorial file-level mapping, 2026-10-11</data>
