<edge source="B094" target="W159" id="ND-109a43afdf59466c">
  <data key="d420">ND_EDITORIAL_COMPARISON</data>
  <data key="d423">Proposizione del file: L’esecuzione notturna richiede una sequenza controllata di job, non soltanto un timer. Confronto (longrun): Confrontare riavvio, stato durevole e progresso verificabile su più sessioni; frequenza di esecuzione e convergenza non sono la stessa proprietà. Scheda W159: Hybrid episodic and semantic storage with retention policies can improve long-horizon consistency and token efficiency.</data>
  <data key="d424">ND.zip; editorial file-level mapping, 2026-10-11</data>
  <data key="d428">ai-auto_eng/AI_AUTO_ENG/chapters/chapter09b_scheduling.tex</data>
  <data key="d483">187</data>
  <data key="d467">EDITORIAL_NOT_EMPIRICAL_VALIDATION</data>
  <data key="d488">longrun</data>
  <data key="d489">Scheduling on macOS (launchd) (L187); Creating plist Files for Scheduled Jobs (L193); Verifying Scheduled Jobs (L353)</data>
  <data key="d490">Frozen v6 node W159 summary/contribution and limitation</data>
  <data key="d491">Synthetic low-code trials; missing real SWE longitudinal validation.</data>
  <data key="d492">NO</data>
  <data key="d493">NO</data>
  <data key="d458">EDITORIAL_ARGUMENTED_UNSCORED</data>
</edge>
