  <data key="d467">EDITORIAL_NOT_EMPIRICAL_VALIDATION</data>
  <data key="d488">loop</data>
  <data key="d489">Ralph Loop (hehamalainen) (L107); Ralph-Wiggums-Copilot-Agent (MWChapelCLA) (L53); Ralph for GitHub Copilot (aymenfurter) (L175)</data>
  <data key="d490">Frozen v6 node W095 summary/contribution and limitation</data>
  <data key="d491">Synthesis only, no new outcome dataset.</data>
  <data key="d492">NO</data>
  <data key="d493">NO</data>
  <data key="d458">EDITORIAL_ARGUMENTED_UNSCORED</data>
</edge>
<edge source="B100" target="O012" id="ND-894481c333bc84fd">
  <data key="d420">ND_EDITORIAL_COMPARISON</data>
  <data key="d423">Proposizione del file: Ralph viene adattato a Copilot tramite estensioni, CLI, subagenti o iterazione manuale. Confronto (loop): Confrontare il loop come unità di lavoro, con stato, controlli e policy esterni. I tre corpus non costituiscono repliche indipendenti dello stesso risultato. Scheda O012: Osmani identifies five interoperable loop-building primitives—scheduling, worktrees, skills, connectors and subagents—plus durable external memory.</data>
  <data key="d424">ND.zip; editorial file-level mapping, 2026-10-11</data>
  <data key="d428">ai-auto_eng/AI_AUTO_ENG/appendices/appendix_d_copilot.tex</data>
