<edge source="B100" target="P110" id="ND-46de8733df8f4cf1">
  <data key="d420">ND_EDITORIAL_COMPARISON</data>
  <data key="d423">Proposizione del file: Ralph viene adattato a Copilot tramite estensioni, CLI, subagenti o iterazione manuale. Confronto (loop): Confrontare il loop come unità di lavoro, con stato, controlli e policy esterni. I tre corpus non costituiscono repliche indipendenti dello stesso risultato. Scheda P110: Orosz traces Ralph-style loops, scheduled triggers and goal-oriented harness features.</data>
  <data key="d424">ND.zip; editorial file-level mapping, 2026-10-11</data>
  <data key="d428">ai-auto_eng/AI_AUTO_ENG/appendices/appendix_d_copilot.tex</data>
  <data key="d483">107</data>
  <data key="d467">EDITORIAL_NOT_EMPIRICAL_VALIDATION</data>
  <data key="d488">loop</data>
  <data key="d489">Ralph Loop (hehamalainen) (L107); Ralph-Wiggums-Copilot-Agent (MWChapelCLA) (L53); Ralph for GitHub Copilot (aymenfurter) (L175)</data>
  <data key="d490">Frozen v6 node P110 summary/contribution and limitation</data>
  <data key="d491">P110 directly links https://addyosmani.com/blog/loop-engineering/ (7 June 2026). O012 catalogues the substantially matching Substack edition (8 June 2026). Treat the edge as discussion of the same underlying work via an alternate edition, not an exact-URL citation. The paid remainder and comparative loop outcomes remain unreviewed. Subscriber-only article remainder not reviewed. No microdata replication, controlled product test, or independent-rater agreement study was performed.</data>
  <data key="d492">NO</data>
  <data key="d493">NO</data>
  <data key="d458">EDITORIAL_ARGUMENTED_UNSCORED</data>
</edge>
<edge source="B100" target="W060" id="ND-32f8c53ec9a26a8a">
  <data key="d420">ND_EDITORIAL_COMPARISON</data>
  <data key="d423">Proposizione del file: Ralph viene adattato a Copilot tramite estensioni, CLI, subagenti o iterazione manuale. Confronto (security): Confrontare superficie di attacco dell’agente, permessi e contenimento; esposizione, dimostrazione di attacco e frequenza degli incidenti non sono misure intercambiabili. Scheda W060: Workspace and retrieved-content injections can induce agents to execute unwanted commands.</data>
  <data key="d424">ND.zip; editorial file-level mapping, 2026-10-11</data>
  <data key="d428">ai-auto_eng/AI_AUTO_ENG/appendices/appendix_d_copilot.tex</data>
  <data key="d483">158</data>
