<edge source="B103" target="W095" id="ND-2b743f48d1b5aefc">
  <data key="d420">ND_EDITORIAL_COMPARISON</data>
  <data key="d423">Proposizione del file: Il sommario introduce il loop come sistema governato, dal modello concettuale all’esecuzione locale. Confronto (loop): Confrontare il loop come unità di lavoro, con stato, controlli e policy esterni. I tre corpus non costituiscono repliche indipendenti dello stesso risultato. Scheda W095: Proposes analyzing the whole agentic lifecycle across verification reliability and cost.</data>
  <data key="d424">ND.zip; editorial file-level mapping, 2026-10-11</data>
  <data key="d428">NDLE/summary_v2.tex</data>
  <data key="d483">26</data>
  <data key="d467">EDITORIAL_NOT_EMPIRICAL_VALIDATION</data>
  <data key="d488">loop</data>
  <data key="d489">How This Book Is Organized (L26)</data>
  <data key="d490">Frozen v6 node W095 summary/contribution and limitation</data>
  <data key="d491">Synthesis only, no new outcome dataset.</data>
  <data key="d492">NO</data>
  <data key="d493">NO</data>
  <data key="d458">EDITORIAL_ARGUMENTED_UNSCORED</data>
</edge>
<edge source="B103" target="O012" id="ND-fbe34889e8c8b7da">
  <data key="d420">ND_EDITORIAL_COMPARISON</data>
  <data key="d423">Proposizione del file: Il sommario introduce il loop come sistema governato, dal modello concettuale all’esecuzione locale. Confronto (loop): Confrontare il loop come unità di lavoro, con stato, controlli e policy esterni. I tre corpus non costituiscono repliche indipendenti dello stesso risultato. Scheda O012: Osmani identifies five interoperable loop-building primitives—scheduling, worktrees, skills, connectors and subagents—plus durable external memory.</data>
  <data key="d424">ND.zip; editorial file-level mapping, 2026-10-11</data>
  <data key="d428">NDLE/summary_v2.tex</data>
  <data key="d483">26</data>
  <data key="d467">EDITORIAL_NOT_EMPIRICAL_VALIDATION</data>
  <data key="d488">loop</data>
  <data key="d489">How This Book Is Organized (L26)</data>
  <data key="d490">Frozen v6 node O012 summary/contribution and limitation</data>
  <data key="d491">A practitioner engineering pattern; the article does not establish comparative loop reliability by controlled experiment.</data>
  <data key="d492">NO</data>
  <data key="d493">NO</data>
