  <data key="d490">Frozen v6 node P110 summary/contribution and limitation</data>
  <data key="d491">P110 directly links https://addyosmani.com/blog/loop-engineering/ (7 June 2026). O012 catalogues the substantially matching Substack edition (8 June 2026). Treat the edge as discussion of the same underlying work via an alternate edition, not an exact-URL citation. The paid remainder and comparative loop outcomes remain unreviewed. Subscriber-only article remainder not reviewed. No microdata replication, controlled product test, or independent-rater agreement study was performed.</data>
