<edge source="B104" target="B085" id="ND-12ae8c148fc640a1">
  <data key="d420">ND_CRITICALLY_REFINES</data>
  <data key="d423">La promessa di sviluppo continuativo viene riesaminata come problema di evidenza, autorità e non-determinismo. Ancoraggi sorgente: Introduction: The Epistemological Transition in Software Development (L12); From /loop to /goal : Native Loop Primitives (L566); Empirical Landscape: What Practitioners Actually Report (L1071); The Joint System: Context, Harness, Evidence, and Policy (L1483). Destinazione: From Reactive to Proactive AI (L25); The Continuous Loop Concept (L117); Prerequisites for Success (L246); What This Book Will Teach You (L319)</data>
  <data key="d424">ND.zip; editorial file-level mapping, 2026-10-11</data>
  <data key="d428">NDLE/new_chapters/chapter01_foundations.tex</data>
  <data key="d483">12</data>
  <data key="d467">EDITORIAL_NOT_EMPIRICAL_VALIDATION</data>
  <data key="d484">EDITORIAL_CONTENT_COMPARISON_NOT_INDEPENDENT_CORROBORATION</data>
</edge>
<edge source="B104" target="B092" id="ND-fad66d79757cdafe">
  <data key="d420">ND_CRITICAL_TENSION</data>
  <data key="d423">Il worker–evaluator split impone di non scambiare self-critique e role stacking per un oracolo indipendente. Ancoraggi sorgente: Introduction: The Epistemological Transition in Software Development (L12); From /loop to /goal : Native Loop Primitives (L566); Empirical Landscape: What Practitioners Actually Report (L1071); The Joint System: Context, Harness, Evidence, and Policy (L1483). Destinazione: Reverse Prompting: Clarification Before Execution (L26); Role Stacking: Multiple Perspectives (L284); The Verification Loop: Self-Critique Patterns (L393); Putting It Together: Technique Selection (L672)</data>
  <data key="d424">ND.zip; editorial file-level mapping, 2026-10-11</data>
  <data key="d428">NDLE/new_chapters/chapter01_foundations.tex</data>
  <data key="d483">12</data>
  <data key="d467">EDITORIAL_NOT_EMPIRICAL_VALIDATION</data>
