<edge source="B105" target="W150" id="ND-724210992effed06">
  <data key="d420">ND_EDITORIAL_COMPARISON</data>
  <data key="d423">Proposizione del file: L’organizzazione deve assegnare responsabilità, capacità di verifica e infrastruttura di conoscenza al lavoro dei loop. Confronto (governance): Confrontare autorità umana, confini decisionali e controlli di esecuzione; policy osservate e casi aziendali non certificano l’efficacia del metodo proposto. Scheda W150: Most policies allow AI while specifying disclosure and human responsibility, suggesting workable rather than absolutist governance.</data>
  <data key="d424">ND.zip; editorial file-level mapping, 2026-10-11</data>
  <data key="d428">NDLE/new_chapters/chapter02_organization.tex</data>
  <data key="d483">166</data>
  <data key="d467">EDITORIAL_NOT_EMPIRICAL_VALIDATION</data>
  <data key="d488">governance</data>
  <data key="d489">Law 3: Accountability Cannot Be Delegated to the Model (L166); Law 5: Effective Governance Must Be Executable (L182); Platform and Governance Steward (L250)</data>
  <data key="d490">Frozen v6 node W150 summary/contribution and limitation</data>
  <data key="d491">Classifies rules but does not measure their safety effect.</data>
  <data key="d492">NO</data>
  <data key="d493">NO</data>
  <data key="d458">EDITORIAL_ARGUMENTED_UNSCORED</data>
</edge>
