<edge source="B105" target="P119" id="ND-5e73ec9b2c71be66">
  <data key="d420">ND_EDITORIAL_COMPARISON</data>
  <data key="d423">Proposizione del file: L’organizzazione deve assegnare responsabilità, capacità di verifica e infrastruttura di conoscenza al lavoro dei loop. Confronto (governance): Confrontare autorità umana, confini decisionali e controlli di esecuzione; policy osservate e casi aziendali non certificano l’efficacia del metodo proposto. Scheda P119: A company-visit report describes Codex adoption, internal integrations and feedback loops extending into performance work and infrastructure.</data>
  <data key="d424">ND.zip; editorial file-level mapping, 2026-10-11</data>
  <data key="d428">NDLE/new_chapters/chapter02_organization.tex</data>
  <data key="d483">166</data>
  <data key="d467">EDITORIAL_NOT_EMPIRICAL_VALIDATION</data>
  <data key="d488">governance</data>
  <data key="d489">Law 3: Accountability Cannot Be Delegated to the Model (L166); Law 5: Effective Governance Must Be Executable (L182); Platform and Governance Steward (L250)</data>
  <data key="d490">Frozen v6 node P119 summary/contribution and limitation</data>
  <data key="d491">Internal integrations, selected interviewees and unusually permissive token budgets limit transfer to other organizations. Subscriber-only article remainder not reviewed. No microdata replication, controlled product test, or independent-rater agreement study was performed.</data>
  <data key="d492">NO</data>
  <data key="d493">NO</data>
  <data key="d458">EDITORIAL_ARGUMENTED_UNSCORED</data>
</edge>
<edge source="B105" target="W123" id="ND-d23aaceb8dd3c423">
  <data key="d420">ND_EDITORIAL_COMPARISON</data>
  <data key="d423">Proposizione del file: L’organizzazione deve assegnare responsabilità, capacità di verifica e infrastruttura di conoscenza al lavoro dei loop. Confronto (roles): Confrontare trasformazione dei compiti, formazione dei junior e dinamiche occupazionali; distinguere previsione, testimonianza e identificazione causale. Scheda W123: Early adopter firms show higher software hiring, especially junior hiring, contradicting simple substitution stories.</data>
  <data key="d424">ND.zip; editorial file-level mapping, 2026-10-11</data>
  <data key="d428">NDLE/new_chapters/chapter02_organization.tex</data>
  <data key="d483">295</data>
  <data key="d467">EDITORIAL_NOT_EMPIRICAL_VALIDATION</data>
  <data key="d488">roles</data>
