<edge source="B106" target="P095" id="ND-ec100251d7c80e61">
  <data key="d420">ND_EDITORIAL_COMPARISON</data>
  <data key="d423">Proposizione del file: L’unità economica diventa l’esito verificato, non il token economico o la velocità del singolo contributore. Confronto (cost): Confrontare il costo dell’intero esito accettato, inclusi verifica e rilavorazione; ROI di scenario e testimonianze di consumo non sono rendimenti sperimentali. Scheda P095: A follow-up analysis of the 2026 reader survey examines tool costs, usage limits, developer identity and uneven changes to engineering work.</data>
  <data key="d424">ND.zip; editorial file-level mapping, 2026-10-11</data>
  <data key="d428">NDLE/new_chapters/chapter03_economics.tex</data>
  <data key="d483">12</data>
  <data key="d467">EDITORIAL_NOT_EMPIRICAL_VALIDATION</data>
  <data key="d488">cost</data>
  <data key="d489">Introduction: From Cheap Assistance to Variable-Cost Production (L12); The Cost Structure of a Loop (L107); Context accumulation and execution cost (L115)</data>
  <data key="d490">Frozen v6 node P095 summary/contribution and limitation</data>
  <data key="d491">Uses the same respondent cohort as AI Tooling 2026 and key trends Part 2; not independent replication. Builders, shippers and coasters are interpretive response groupings, not a validated psychological or competency typology. The author reports 906 responses for the shared 2026 cohort. This is not an independently counted sample; comparisons with other survey waves are not a matched longitudinal panel. Subscriber-only article remainder not reviewed. No microdata replication, controlled product test, or independent-rater agreement study was performed.</data>
  <data key="d492">NO</data>
  <data key="d493">NO</data>
  <data key="d458">EDITORIAL_ARGUMENTED_UNSCORED</data>
</edge>
<edge source="B106" target="W010" id="ND-1aa9035ae9944f95">
  <data key="d420">ND_EDITORIAL_COMPARISON</data>
  <data key="d423">Proposizione del file: L’unità economica diventa l’esito verificato, non il token economico o la velocità del singolo contributore. Confronto (productivity): Confrontare output generato, cambiamento integrato e valore rilasciato. Adozione e velocità percepita non misurano da sole produttività netta. Scheda W010: Agent advances raise commits substantially more than releases; delivery throughput has lower elasticity than coding throughput.</data>
  <data key="d424">ND.zip; editorial file-level mapping, 2026-10-11</data>
  <data key="d428">NDLE/new_chapters/chapter03_economics.tex</data>
  <data key="d483">317</data>
  <data key="d467">EDITORIAL_NOT_EMPIRICAL_VALIDATION</data>
  <data key="d488">productivity</data>
  <data key="d489">The Individual Contributor: Productivity Is Heterogeneous (L317); The productivity ratchet (L410); The Organization: Local Speed Is Not System Throughput (L455)</data>
  <data key="d490">Frozen v6 node W010 summary/contribution and limitation</data>
  <data key="d491">GitHub activity and matched designs do not establish business value.</data>
  <data key="d492">NO</data>
  <data key="d493">NO</data>
  <data key="d458">EDITORIAL_ARGUMENTED_UNSCORED</data>
</edge>
