  <data key="d420">ND_OPERATIONALIZES</data>
  <data key="d423">L’implementazione del loop viene inserita in un runtime locale completo, con supply chain, policy e telemetria. Ancoraggi sorgente: The Decisive Shift: From Local Inference to Local Engineering (L12); Configuration as a Control Plane (L816); Loop Modes and Human Authority (L1345); The Durable Engineering Principles (L1725). Destinazione: Environment Verification (L14); Plan File Templates (L1153); Planning Mode Prompt (L1332); Checklist for Production Use (L1474)</data>
  <data key="d424">ND.zip; editorial file-level mapping, 2026-10-11</data>
