<edge source="B109" target="T:Verification &amp; review" id="ND-ba891ac116472f8e">
  <data key="d420">ND_PRIMARY_STREAM</data>
  <data key="d423">Si sceglie il meccanismo minimo che affronta un fallimento osservato e dispone di un segnale esterno verificabile. Ancoraggi: From a Complete Architecture to a Selective Operating Model (L12); Technique Family IV: Budget, Observability, and Guardrails (L628); A Build Sequence That Minimizes Accidental Complexity (L1163); Conclusion: Engineering Accountable Autonomy (L1565)</data>
